analysis with QUANTITATIVE tables (not just prose\n    — Dream best-tier W1). CKA cliff steepness explains Qwen-Llama tradeoff strength\n    difference (qualitative). Frame as \"geometric/correlational analysis\" NOT \"mechanistic\n    explanation\" (Dream RD6/RD9).\n\n    '\n- id: plan_012\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Linear projection sensitivity analysis: vary number of parallel pairs\n    (10, 20, 50, 100, 200) for linear projection transfer. Determines minimum data\n    requirement for this surprisingly strong baseline. Both models × 5 representative\n    layers × 20 languages.\n\n    '\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps:\n  - plan_001\n  - plan_002\n  notes: CPU-bound, uses cached activations. Dream review D11.\n- id: plan_013\n  claim: 1\n  registry_id: plan_013\n  description: 'Probing control tasks (Hewitt & Liang 2019): train probes on randomly\n    permuted labels at each layer. Compare selectivity (probe AUROC - control AUROC)\n    across layers and languages. Validates that high AUROC reflects genuine correctness\n    direction, not memorized dataset artifacts or probe capacity.\n\n    '\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps:\n  - plan_001\n  - plan_002\n  notes: 'CPU-bound. Dream review D22: probing methodology critique. SELECTIVITY THRESHOLD\n    SENSITIVITY (D015): Test at 0.03, 0.05, 0.10 thresholds (Hewitt & Liang used 0.05\n    for English syntactic probing; may not be appropriate for multilingual correctness).\n    Report artifact rate at each threshold. Trivial to compute from existing data\n    (plan_013 v2 already running).\n\n    '\n- id: plan_008\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Gemma 4 32.7B Dense (60 text layers, dense, BF16): third architecture\n    for core submission. Full Pareto frontier at every 4th layer + final (16 probed\n    layers), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions. BF16 (~62.5GB, fits single 96GB\n    GPU). Provides dense vs MoE architectural contrast — addresses #1 reviewer concern\n    across ALL dream tiers (\"architecture comparison confounded\").\n\n    '\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 30\n  deps: []\n  notes: 'Upgraded P2→P0 (D016). User providing 4× RTX 6000 96G on second server.\n    Model: google/gemma-4-31B (HF) / ModelScope. Apache 2.0, no gating. MULTIMODAL:\n    has vision encoder (27 extra layers) — extract_activations.py must hook ONLY text\n    decoder layers (60 layers), skip vision. Code may need adjustment. BF16 ~62.5GB\n    (2 shards: 49.8 + 12.8GB), single 96GB GPU sufficient. No quantization needed\n    — eliminates quantization confound for this model.\n\n    '\n- id: plan_009\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Extended language coverage: expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready.\n    Leverages GlobalMMLU/Belebele full language sets.\n\n    '\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 50\n  deps:\n  - plan_001\n  - plan_002\n- id: mvp_validation\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'MVP: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 6 languages, 8 layers, zero-shot + mean-shift'\n  priority: P0\n  registry_id: mvp_001\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps: []\n- id: mvp_complementary\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'MVP robustness: complementary layer set (2,6,10,14,18,22,26)'\n  priority: P1\n  registry_id: mvp_002\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps:\n  - mvp_validation\n- id: mvp_llama_control\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'MVP cross-architecture: Llama-3.1-8B control experiment'\n  priority: P1\n  registry_id: mvp_003\n  gpu_budget_hours: 3\n  deps:\n  - mvp_validation\n","numLines":286,"startLine":1,"totalLines":286}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K9vTyKxwVc9FQmALh8nzWG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: best\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。以 Simpson''s Paradox 几何洞见为核心新颖性开篇—— raw CKA-transfer\n3\t  correlation 为负（depth confound），partial correlation controlling for depth 在双架构上均显著为正（p\n4\t  < 0.01），揭示 within-layer CKA genuinely predicts transfer quality。CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献（+3.5pp\n5\t  mean over ZS），不是 headline 但 构成因果链第三环。标题强调 ''geometric analysis reveals when and\n6\t  why cross-lingual calibration transfer succeeds''。四条 claim 完整因果链保留：Pareto discovery（architecture-\n7\t  dependent depth-transferability tradeoff）→ Decomposition analysis（difficulty vs\n8\t  capability separation）→ CaCLR method（consistency loss provides measurable gain at\n9\t  deep layers）→ CKA geometric explanation（Simpson''s Paradox, subspace persistence）。\n10\t  Control task warning（28% low-resource artifacts）和 linear projection sample efficiency\n11\t  （~42 pairs to 95%）作为加分实证贡献。Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52） 为 practitioner\n12\t  提供直接指导。无需弱化任何 claims。\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n17\t  plan_id: plan_001\n18\t  description: '94-layer MoE (INT4, ~22B active), 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20\n19\t    typologically diverse languages, English logistic regression probes, 5 transfer\n20\t    conditions: zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection (200 pairs), few-shot 25/100,\n21\t    CaCLR。重点验证 MVP 发现的 strong depth-transferability tradeoff 是否在大模型上保持。\n22\t\n23\t    '\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    en_best_auroc: 0.81\n26\t    en_best_layer_idx: 72\n27\t    en_auroc_range:\n28\t    - 0.58\n29\t    - 0.81\n30\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.168\n31\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.72\n32\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 52\n33\t    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.9\n34\t    zs_fail_langs:\n35\t    - yo\n36\t    - te\n37\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n38\t      HIGH_mean: 0.76\n39\t      MID_mean: 0.72\n40\t      LOW_mean: 0.63\n41\t    zs_auroc_selected:\n42\t      zh: 0.77\n43\t      es: 0.76\n44\t      fr: 0.76\n45\t      de: 0.77\n46\t      ja: 0.75\n47\t      nl: 0.76\n48\t      pt: 0.75\n49\t      it: 0.75\n50\t      ar: 0.73\n51\t      hi: 0.71\n52\t      ko: 0.72\n53\t      tr: 0.71\n54\t      ru: 0.74\n55\t      vi: 0.7\n56\t      th: 0.69\n57\t      sw: 0.63\n58\t      bn: 0.65\n59\t      yo: 0.57\n60\t      ig: 0.61\n61\t      te: 0.58\n62\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.64\n63\t    per_lang_significant_at_005: 15\n64\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.91\n65\t    global_spearman_p: 0.0001\n66\t    pareto_frontier_layers:\n67\t    - 40\n68\t    - 44\n69\t    - 48\n70\t    - 52\n71\t    - 56\n72\t    pareto_en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp: 4.2\n73\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n74\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.74\n75\t    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.708\n76\t    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.735\n77\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B 的 22B active params 比 MVP Qwen2.5-7B 多 3×，log-linear\n78\t    probing scaling 预期 EN AUROC 从 0.754 提升至 ~0.81。94 层深网络使 depth-transferability tradeoff\n79\t    比 28 层 MVP 更显著：EN-optimal layer (L72, 77% depth) 与 ZS-optimal layer (L52, 55%\n80\t    depth) 之间有 20 层间隔（MVP 仅 3 层）。Strong Pareto 源于 Qwen 架构特征：MoE routing 在深层产生 language-specific\n81\t    expert 激活模式， 导致 correctness direction 的 cross-lingual alignment 在 L60 后急剧下降。 15/20\n82\t    languages 的 per-language Spearman rho 显著为负，表明 tradeoff 是 跨语言一致的。2 个 fail 语言（yo,\n83\t    te）的 AUROC < 0.60 因为 Qwen3 pretraining corpus 中 Yoruba/Telugu 占比极低（<0.1%），embedding\n84\t    层的 representation quality 即不足以支撑 correctness signal。Mean-shift ΔAUROC ≡ 0 因为 StandardScaler\n85\t    + LR 下 mean-shift 对 AUROC 无影响（已在 MVP 中数学证明）。 Linear projection (200 pairs) 提供\n86\t    +2pp 因为 Procrustes alignment 捕获了 correctness subspace 的旋转，但不触及 distributional\n87\t    matching。\n88\t\n89\t    '\n90\t  tables:\n91\t  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier (selected layers)'\n92\t    columns:\n93\t    - layer_idx\n94\t    - depth_pct\n95\t    - en_auroc\n96\t    - zs_mean_20\n97\t    - zs_drop_pp\n98\t    - on_pareto\n99\t    rows:\n100\t    - - 4\n101\t      - 4\n102\t      - 0.58\n103\t      - 0.572\n104\t      - 0.8\n105\t      - false\n106\t    - - 12\n107\t      - 13\n108\t      - 0.645\n109\t      - 0.632\n110\t      - 1.3\n111\t      - false\n112\t    - - 20\n113\t      - 21\n114\t      - 0.71\n115\t      - 0.695\n116\t      - 1.5\n117\t      - false\n118\t    - - 28\n119\t      - 30\n120\t      - 0.752\n121\t      - 0.733\n122\t      - 1.9\n123\t      - false\n124\t    - - 36\n125\t      - 38\n126\t      - 0.778\n127\t      - 0.752\n128\t      - 2.6\n129\t      - false\n130\t    - - 40\n131\t      - 43\n132\t      - 0.788\n133\t      - 0.748\n134\t      - 4.0\n135\t      - true\n136\t    - - 44\n137\t      - 47\n138\t      - 0.796\n139\t      - 0.74\n140\t      - 5.6\n141\t      - true\n142\t    - - 48\n143\t      - 51\n144\t      - 0.802\n145\t      - 0.732\n146\t      - 7.0\n147\t      - true\n148\t    - - 52\n149\t      - 55\n150\t      - 0.806\n151\t      - 0.72\n152\t      - 8.6\n153\t      - true\n154\t    - - 56\n155\t      - 60\n156\t      - 0.808\n157\t      - 0.706\n158\t      - 10.2\n159\t      - true\n160\t    - - 60\n161\t      - 64\n162\t      - 0.81\n163\t      - 0.69\n164\t      - 12.0\n165\t      - false\n166\t    - - 68\n167\t      - 72\n168\t      - 0.81\n169\t      - 0.661\n170\t      - 14.9\n171\t      - false\n172\t    - - 72\n173\t      - 77\n174\t      - 0.81\n175\t      - 0.638\n176\t      - 17.2\n177\t      - false\n178\t    - - 80\n179\t      - 85\n180\t      - 0.805\n181\t      - 0.601\n182\t      - 20.4\n183\t      - false\n184\t    - - 88\n185\t      - 94\n186\t      - 0.792\n187\t      - 0.558\n188\t      - 23.4\n189\t      - false\n190\t    - - 92\n191\t      - 98\n192\t      - 0.778\n193\t      - 0.531\n194\t      - 24.7\n195\t      - false\n196\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Language Spearman ρ (depth vs ZS AUROC), Qwen3'\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - language\n199\t    - tier\n200\t    - spearman_rho\n201\t    - p_value\n202\t    - significant\n203\t    rows:\n204\t    - - zh\n205\t      - HIGH\n206\t      - -0.72\n207\t      - 0.001\n208\t      - true\n209\t    - - es\n210\t      - HIGH\n211\t      - -0.68\n212\t      - 0.002\n213\t      - true\n214\t    - - fr\n215\t      - HIGH\n216\t      - -0.7\n217\t      - 0.001\n218\t      - true\n219\t    - - de\n220\t      - HIGH\n221\t      - -0.69\n222\t      - 0.002\n223\t      - true\n224\t    - - ja\n225\t      - HIGH\n226\t      - -0.74\n227\t      - 0.001\n228\t      - true\n229\t    - - nl\n230\t      - HIGH\n231\t      - -0.67\n232\t      - 0.003\n233\t      - true\n234\t    - - pt\n235\t      - MID\n236\t      - -0.65\n237\t      - 0.004\n238\t      - true\n239\t    - - it\n240\t      - MID\n241\t      - -0.66\n242\t      - 0.003\n243\t      - true\n244\t    - - ar\n245\t      - MID\n246\t      - -0.71\n247\t      - 0.001\n248\t      - true\n249\t    - - hi\n250\t      - MID\n251\t      - -0.63\n252\t      - 0.005\n253\t      - true\n254\t    - - ko\n255\t      - MID\n256\t      - -0.67\n257\t      - 0.003\n258\t      - true\n259\t    - - tr\n260\t      - MID\n261\t      - -0.62\n262\t      - 0.006\n263\t      - true\n264\t    - - ru\n265\t      - MID\n266\t      - -0.69\n267\t      - 0.002\n268\t      - true\n269\t    - - vi\n270\t      - MID\n271\t      - -0.61\n272\t      - 0.008\n273\t      - true\n274\t    - - th\n275\t      - MID\n276\t      - -0.58\n277\t      - 0.012\n278\t      - true\n279\t    - - sw\n280\t      - LOW\n281\t      - -0.52\n282\t      - 0.025\n283\t      - true\n284\t    - - bn\n285\t      - LOW\n286\t      - -0.55\n287\t      - 0.018\n288\t      - false\n289\t    - - yo\n290\t      - LOW\n291\t      - -0.48\n292\t      - 0.042\n293\t      - false\n294\t    - - ig\n295\t      - LOW\n296\t      - -0.51\n297\t      - 0.028\n298\t      - false\n299\t    - - te\n300\t      - LOW\n301\t      - -0.45\n302\t      - 0.058\n303\t      - false\n304\t  figures_description:\n305\t  - 'Figure 1a: Pareto frontier scatter (EN AUROC x-axis vs ZS mean AUROC y-axis),\n306\t    24 points, 5 Pareto-optimal layers marked red. Clear convex knee at ~55% depth.\n307\t\n308\t    '\n309\t  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered by resource tier)\n310\t    × normalized depth (x-axis). Warm mid-band, low-resource rows cool earlier at\n311\t    shallower depth than high-resource rows.\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent depth-transferability tradeoff： global\n315\t    Spearman ρ = -0.91 (p < 0.001), 15/20 per-language ρ 显著为负。 Pareto frontier 包含\n316\t    5 层 (L40-L56)，knee 在 ~55% depth。EN-optimal (L72) 与 ZS-optimal (L52) 相隔 20 层 /\n317\t    22pp depth，远大于 MVP 的 3 层 间隔。这证实 tradeoff 在大模型上不是减弱而是放大——更深的网络有更多 空间进行 language-specific\n318\t    specialization。High-resource 语言在 Pareto knee 以下也保持 AUROC > 0.74，但 low-resource\n319\t    在 70% depth 后急剧下降。 这与 CKA 分析一致：CKA 在 L60 后的 cliff 解释了为何 deep-layer transfer 对\n320\t    low-resource 影响更大（CKA 基线更低，cliff 更早触及）。\n321\t\n322\t    '\n323\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n324\t  plan_id: plan_002\n325\t  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n326\t    4th), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak/mixed tradeoff\n327\t    pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  expected_results:\n331\t    en_best_auroc: 0.79\n332\t    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n333\t    en_auroc_range:\n334\t    - 0.56\n335\t    - 0.79\n336\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.182\n337\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.7\n338\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n339\t    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.85\n340\t    zs_fail_langs:\n341\t    - yo\n342\t    - te\n343\t    - ig\n344\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n345\t      HIGH_mean: 0.74\n346\t      MID_mean: 0.7\n347\t      LOW_mean: 0.61\n348\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n349\t    per_lang_significant_at_005: 6\n350\t    per_lang_positive_rho_langs:\n351\t    - ar\n352\t    - hi\n353\t    - ko\n354\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.78\n355\t    global_spearman_p: 0.003\n356\t    pareto_frontier_layers:\n357\t    - 20\n358\t    - 24\n359\t    - 28\n360\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n361\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.718\n362\t    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.692\n363\t    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.718\n364\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak tradeoff 模式。虽然 global\n365\t    Spearman ρ = -0.78 仍然显著（12 data points, p=0.003），但 per-language 分析揭示了明显的异质性：仅\n366\t    6/20 languages 有显著负 ρ，而 ar/hi/ko 展现正 ρ（深层 transfer 反而改善）。这与 MVP 完全一致（ar/ko 在 L31\n367\t    优于 L20），且可归因于 Llama 架构的 multilingual training recipe：Meta 的训练策略使 ar/hi/ko 在深层保持更好的\n368\t    cross-lingual alignment，可能 因为这些语言在 pretraining 中与 English 有更多 code-switching 数据。\n369\t    Global rho 仍然显著是因为大多数语言确实有弱负趋势，但 per-language 分析揭示这不是 universal pattern。与 Qwen3\n370\t    的对比清晰：Qwen3 的 15/20 significant vs Llama4 的 6/20，median rho -0.64 vs -0.28。这一\n371\t    architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 的核心发现。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t  tables:\n375\t  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n376\t    columns:\n377\t    - layer_idx\n378\t    - depth_pct\n379\t    - en_auroc\n380\t    - zs_mean_20\n381\t    - zs_drop_pp\n382\t    - on_pareto\n383\t    rows:\n384\t    - - 4\n385\t      - 8\n386\t      - 0.56\n387\t      - 0.552\n388\t      - 0.8\n389\t      - false\n390\t    - - 8\n391\t      - 17\n392\t      - 0.635\n393\t      - 0.625\n394\t      - 1.0\n395\t      - false\n396\t    - - 12\n397\t      - 25\n398\t      - 0.695\n399\t      - 0.682\n400\t      - 1.3\n401\t      - false\n402\t    - - 16\n403\t      - 33\n404\t      - 0.735\n405\t      - 0.718\n406\t      - 1.7\n407\t      - false\n408\t    - - 20\n409\t      - 42\n410\t      - 0.758\n411\t      - 0.724\n412\t      - 3.4\n413\t      - true\n414\t    - - 24\n415\t      - 50\n416\t      - 0.772\n417\t      - 0.714\n418\t      - 5.8\n419\t      - true\n420\t    - - 28\n421\t      - 58\n422\t      - 0.782\n423\t      - 0.7\n424\t      - 8.2\n425\t      - true\n426\t    - - 32\n427\t      - 67\n428\t      - 0.789\n429\t      - 0.681\n430\t      - 10.8\n431\t      - false\n432\t    - - 36\n433\t      - 75\n434\t      - 0.79\n435\t      - 0.655\n436\t      - 13.5\n437\t      - false\n438\t    - - 40\n439\t      - 83\n440\t      - 0.785\n441\t      - 0.625\n442\t      - 16.0\n443\t      - false\n444\t    - - 44\n445\t      - 92\n446\t      - 0.772\n447\t      - 0.589\n448\t      - 18.3\n449\t      - false\n450\t    - - 48\n451\t      - 100\n452\t      - 0.748\n453\t      - 0.548\n454\t      - 20.0\n455\t      - false\n456\t  - name: 'Table 4: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Comparison'\n457\t    columns:\n458\t    - metric\n459\t    - Qwen3_235B\n460\t    - Llama4_Scout\n461\t    - interpretation\n462\t    rows:\n463\t    - - global_rho\n464\t      - -0.91\n465\t      - -0.78\n466\t      - both significant but Qwen stronger\n467\t    - - per_lang_sig_count\n468\t      - 15/20\n469\t      - 6/20\n470\t      - Qwen consistent, Llama mixed\n471\t    - - median_per_lang_rho\n472\t      - -0.64\n473\t      - -0.28\n474\t      - 2.3x difference in effect size\n475\t    - - positive_rho_langs\n476\t      - 0\n477\t      - 3\n478\t      - Llama has ar/hi/ko reversed\n479\t    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n480\t      - 55\n481\t      - 58\n482\t      - comparable location\n483\t    - - en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp\n484\t      - 4.2\n485\t      - 3.4\n486\t      - comparable magnitude\n487\t  - name: 'Table 5: Transfer Conditions Comparison (both models, at best-transfer\n488\t      layer)'\n489\t    columns:\n490\t    - condition\n491\t    - Qwen3_mean_20\n492\t    - Llama4_mean_20\n493\t    - combined_mean\n494\t    rows:\n495\t    - - zero-shot\n496\t      - 0.72\n497\t      - 0.7\n498\t      - 0.71\n499\t    - - mean-shift\n500\t      - 0.72\n501\t      - 0.7\n502\t      - 0.71\n503\t    - - linear_proj_200\n504\t      - 0.74\n505\t      - 0.718\n506\t      - 0.729\n507\t    - - few-shot-25\n508\t      - 0.708\n509\t      - 0.692\n510\t      - 0.7\n511\t    - - few-shot-100\n512\t      - 0.735\n513\t      - 0.718\n514\t      - 0.727\n515\t  figures_description:\n516\t  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth), Qwen3 in blue, Llama4\n517\t    in orange. Qwen3 shifted up-right with steeper descent; Llama4 flatter with more\n518\t    scatter at deep layers.\n519\t\n520\t    '\n521\t  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution: Qwen3 (left) tightly clustered\n522\t    around -0.65; Llama4 (right) spread from -0.50 to +0.35, ar/hi/ko clearly positive.\n523\t\n524\t    '\n525\t  analysis: 'Architecture-dependent Pareto strength 是 Claim 1 的核心。两个架构的 global rho\n526\t    都显著（满足 pareto_spearman_rho_significant_archs = 2 的 约束），但 effect size 差异明显。Qwen3\n527\t    的 strong tradeoff 意味着 practitioner 必须在 EN accuracy 和 transfer quality 之间做明确选择；\n528\t    Llama4 的 weak tradeoff 意味着某些语言（ar, hi, ko）可以 \"free-ride\" 深层的 EN improvement 而不牺牲\n529\t    transfer。这一差异无法从 domain adaptation theory 预测——它是架构特有的 empirical finding。 Best-transfer\n530\t    depth 在两个架构上收敛至 55-58%，暗示一个 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"，但 frontier 的 steepness\n531\t    是 architecture-specific。\n532\t\n533\t    '\n534\t- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\n535\t  plan_id: plan_011\n536\t  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n537\t    × 2 models。核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n538\t    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n539\t    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。验证\n540\t    pilot finding 的 Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上双架构复现。\n541\t\n542\t    '\n543\t  expected_results:\n544\t    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.36\n545\t    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n546\t    llama4_raw_rho: -0.41\n547\t    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n548\t    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n549\t    qwen3_partial_p: 0.002\n550\t    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n551\t    - 0.31\n552\t    - 0.62\n553\t    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n554\t    llama4_partial_p: 0.008\n555\t    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n556\t    - 0.22\n557\t    - 0.57\n558\t    simpson_paradox_confirmed_both_archs: true\n559\t    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count: 18\n560\t    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count: 6\n561\t    llama4_per_layer_positive_count: 9\n562\t    llama4_per_layer_significant_count: 3\n563\t    qwen3_cka_peak_layer: 16\n564\t    qwen3_cka_peak_value: 0.82\n565\t    qwen3_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.28\n566\t    qwen3_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 55\n567\t    llama4_cka_peak_layer: 12\n568\t    llama4_cka_peak_value: 0.84\n569\t    llama4_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.35\n570\t    llama4_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 50\n571\t    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n572\t    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.58\n573\t    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.72\n574\t    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.4\n575\t    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 38.7\n576\t    correctness_direction_persists_despite_global_cka_decline: true\n577\t  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n578\t    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 transfer AUROC（deeper → EN probe stronger\n579\t    → higher absolute AUROC up to a point），创造了一个 confound。 Raw pooled correlation\n580\t    为负是因为 shallow layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC （probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA\n581\t    但 higher AUROC（probe 强虽然 transfer degrades）。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher\n582\t    CKA 的 语言确实有 better transfer，partial rho 为正。\n583\t\n584\t    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 rho=+0.41, p=0.006。 Full-scale（20 langs\n585\t    × 12-24 layers）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20，partial correlation 的 bootstrap\n586\t    CI 不含零。\n587\t\n588\t    Qwen3 partial rho (0.48) 高于 Llama4 (0.41)，与 Qwen 的 steeper CKA cliff 一致：Qwen 的\n589\t    CKA 变异范围更大（peak 0.82 → floor 0.28 vs Llama 0.84 → 0.35），为 partial correlation\n590\t    提供更多 signal。\n591\t\n592\t    MVP Qwen pilot 仅 rho=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale上升至 0.48 是因为： (1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power\n593\t    大幅提升；(2) 20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了 yo/ig/te 等极低 CKA 语言和 nl/pt 等高 CKA 语言）， 扩大了 within-layer\n594\t    variance。\n595\t\n596\t    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 标记了 \"transfer collapse zone\"：当 CKA 低于此阈值时，correctness\n597\t    direction 的 cross-lingual overlap 不足以 支撑 zero-shot transfer。Subspace angle analysis\n598\t    揭示 correctness direction 在同一 layer 内跨语言仅旋转 ~12°（highly aligned），但跨 layer 旋转 ~39°（significant\n599\t    drift），解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer 但 raw pooled 不预测。\n600\t\n601\t    '\n602\t  tables:\n603\t  - name: 'Table 6: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation'\n604\t    columns:\n605\t    - model\n606\t    - analysis\n607\t    - spearman_rho\n608\t    - p_value\n609\t    - bootstrap_95CI\n610\t    - interpretation\n611\t    rows:\n612\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n613\t      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n614\t      - -0.36\n615\t      - <0.001\n616\t      - '[-0.44, -0.27]'\n617\t      - negative — depth confound\n618\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n619\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n620\t      - 0.48\n621\t      - 0.002\n622\t      - '[+0.31, +0.62]'\n623\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n624\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n625\t      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n626\t      - -0.41\n627\t      - <0.001\n628\t      - '[-0.50, -0.31]'\n629\t      - negative — depth confound\n630\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n631\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n632\t      - 0.41\n633\t      - 0.008\n634\t      - '[+0.22, +0.57]'\n635\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n636\t  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Layer CKA-Transfer Correlation (Qwen3, selected layers)'\n637\t    columns:\n638\t    - layer_idx\n639\t    - depth_pct\n640\t    - mean_CKA_20lang\n641\t    - spearman_rho_n20\n642\t    - p_value\n643\t    rows:\n644\t    - - 12\n645\t      - 13\n646\t      - 0.78\n647\t      - 0.52\n648\t      - 0.019\n649\t    - - 20\n650\t      - 21\n651\t      - 0.81\n652\t      - 0.48\n653\t      - 0.032\n654\t    - - 28\n655\t      - 30\n656\t      - 0.76\n657\t      - 0.55\n658\t      - 0.012\n659\t    - - 36\n660\t      - 38\n661\t      - 0.68\n662\t      - 0.51\n663\t      - 0.022\n664\t    - - 44\n665\t      - 47\n666\t      - 0.56\n667\t      - 0.46\n668\t      - 0.041\n669\t    - - 52\n670\t      - 55\n671\t      - 0.45\n672\t      - 0.43\n673\t      - 0.058\n674\t    - - 60\n675\t      - 64\n676\t      - 0.38\n677\t      - 0.38\n678\t      - 0.098\n679\t    - - 68\n680\t      - 72\n681\t      - 0.3\n682\t      - 0.33\n683\t      - 0.155\n684\t    - - 72\n685\t      - 77\n686\t      - 0.28\n687\t      - 0.28\n688\t      - 0.231\n689\t    - - 80\n690\t      - 85\n691\t      - 0.22\n692\t      - 0.21\n693\t      - 0.372\n694\t  - name: 'Table 8: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n695\t    columns:\n696\t    - depth_pct\n697\t    - HIGH_CKA\n698\t    - MID_CKA\n699\t    - LOW_CKA\n700\t    - overall_CKA\n701\t    rows:\n702\t    - - 13\n703\t      - 0.86\n704\t      - 0.79\n705\t      - 0.62\n706\t      - 0.78\n707\t    - - 30\n708\t      - 0.84\n709\t      - 0.77\n710\t      - 0.58\n711\t      - 0.76\n712\t    - - 47\n713\t      - 0.68\n714\t      - 0.56\n715\t      - 0.35\n716\t      - 0.56\n717\t    - - 64\n718\t      - 0.48\n719\t      - 0.37\n720\t      - 0.22\n721\t      - 0.38\n722\t    - - 77\n723\t      - 0.38\n724\t      - 0.27\n725\t      - 0.14\n726\t      - 0.28\n727\t    - - 94\n728\t      - 0.25\n729\t      - 0.18\n730\t      - 0.09\n731\t      - 0.19\n732\t  - name: 'Table 9: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction)'\n733\t    columns:\n734\t    - comparison_type\n735\t    - mean_angle_deg\n736\t    - std_deg\n737\t    - interpretation\n738\t    rows:\n739\t    - - within-layer cross-language (same layer, different langs)\n740\t      - 12.4\n741\t      - 5.8\n742\t      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n743\t    - - cross-layer same-language (same lang, different layers)\n744\t      - 38.7\n745\t      - 11.2\n746\t      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n747\t    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n748\t      - 87.3\n749\t      - 2.1\n750\t      - near-orthogonal — signal is non-trivial\n751\t  figures_description:\n752\t  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization — left panel: raw scatter (CKA vs\n753\t    ZS AUROC) showing negative trend with depth-colored points; right panel: partial\n754\t    residual plot after controlling for depth showing positive trend. Two panels side\n755\t    by side dramatically illustrate the sign reversal.\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for Qwen3 (main) and Llama4 (inset).\n759\t    Color intensity = CKA value. Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool\n760\t    (deep, low CKA), with low-resource languages cooling faster.\n761\t\n762\t    '\n763\t  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter — transfer AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), vertical dashed\n764\t    line at CKA=0.35 showing transfer collapse zone.\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在双架构上显著复现（partial rho Qwen=+0.48 p=0.002, Llama=+0.41\n768\t    p=0.008），是本文的核心几何洞见。这不是 trivially expected from measurement overlap（CKA 和 transfer\n769\t    AUROC 都衡量 EN-target 相似性） ——sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。\n770\t\n771\t    Subspace angle analysis 提供 mechanistic grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n772\t    内跨语言仅 ~12° 偏差（near-universal），但跨 layer 偏差 ~39°（significant rotation）。这解释了为何 CKA（衡量全局\n773\t    representation similarity）与 transfer（衡量 correctness direction alignment）的关系 需要控制\n774\t    depth 后才能显现：全局 CKA 下降反映的是 non-correctness dimensions 的 divergence，correctness\n775\t    subspace 本身作为 low-dimensional feature 持续存在。\n776\t\n777\t    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 Qwen3 vs Llama4 tradeoff 差异： Qwen3 的 CKA cliff\n778\t    更陡（L52→L60 从 0.45 降至 0.38），导致更多语言 在 deep layers 穿越 threshold → strong tradeoff；Llama4\n779\t    的 cliff 更缓 （L28→L36 从 0.55 降至 0.45），且 ar/hi/ko 因高 baseline CKA 从不穿越 threshold\n780\t    → weak/mixed tradeoff。\n781\t\n782\t    这一分析将 Claim 1 的 Pareto observation 与 CKA geometry 连接，构成 完整的 geometric explanation：architecture-dependent\n783\t    CKA cliff steepness → architecture-dependent Pareto frontier strength。\n784\t\n785\t    '\n786\t- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n787\t  plan_id: plan_003\n788\t  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits).\n789\t    English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU test-split 70/30 partition.\n790\t    Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across full Pareto frontier,\n791\t    both models × 20 languages. α sweep [0.01–10], β sweep [0.001–1.0] across 3 OOM.\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t  expected_results:\n795\t    best_alpha: 0.1\n796\t    best_beta: 0.05\n797\t    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.035\n798\t    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_linproj: 0.015\n799\t    caclr_improvement_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.8\n800\t    caclr_improvement_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n801\t    caclr_improvement_pass_rate: 0.88\n802\t    qwen3_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.757\n803\t    qwen3_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.7\n804\t    qwen3_caclr_ece_mean: 0.078\n805\t    llama4_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.733\n806\t    llama4_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n807\t    llama4_caclr_ece_mean: 0.085\n808\t    beta_0001_delta_pp: 0.5\n809\t    beta_001_delta_pp: 1.8\n810\t    beta_005_delta_pp: 3.5\n811\t    beta_01_delta_pp: 3.2\n812\t    beta_10_delta_pp: 0.8\n813\t    alpha_001_ece_improvement_pp: 1.5\n814\t    alpha_01_ece_improvement_pp: 3.2\n815\t    alpha_10_ece_improvement_pp: 2.8\n816\t    alpha_100_ece_improvement_pp: -0.5\n817\t    bce_only_auroc: 0.71\n818\t    bce_sbece_auroc: 0.722\n819\t    bce_consistency_auroc: 0.738\n820\t    bce_sbece_consistency_auroc: 0.745\n821\t    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n822\t    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%\n823\t    epochs: 50\n824\t    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc\n825\t    initialization: from standard LR solution\n826\t    batch_size: 256\n827\t    mmd_items: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n828\t    parallel_set_size_range:\n829\t    - 1800\n830\t    - 4200\n831\t  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD on 1-D logits) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n832\t    features：EN 和 target-language 的 probe 输出分布 应相似。在 1-D logit space 中，MMD 有效地匹配了两种语言的\n833\t    logit mean 和 variance，等价于让 probe direction 靠近 CKA analysis 中揭示的 \"universal correctness\n834\t    subspace\"。\n835\t\n836\t    +3.5pp mean delta（[2, 5] range 内）反映了 1-D MMD 的能力边界：它能 捕获 first-order distributional\n837\t    alignment（mean/variance matching）， 但无法完成 full rotational alignment（需要 d-dimensional\n838\t    操作）。Linear projection（+2pp）通过 Procrustes 做了 rotational alignment 但不优化 probe 本身；CaCLR\n839\t    的优势在于 end-to-end 优化但受 1-D 约束。两者差距 仅 1.5pp，说明 correctness transfer 的瓶颈主要是 rotational（线性\n840\t    投影解决的）而非 distributional（MMD 解决的）。\n841\t\n842\t    β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现 \"sweet spot\"：β=0.001 太弱（gradient noise > signal），β=1.0\n843\t    太强（MMD 主导 BCE，probe accuracy 下降 2pp）。 Optimal β=0.05 平衡了 accuracy 和 consistency。\n844\t\n845\t    Deep-layer improvement (+4.8pp) 远大于 shallow-layer (+1.2pp)，因为 deep layers 有更大的\n846\t    capability-specific component（Claim 2 decomposition 所揭示），CaCLR 的 consistency loss\n847\t    正好 target 这个 component。这与 difficulty-capability decomposition 形成因果闭环。\n848\t\n849\t    88% improvement pass rate（35/40 model-lang pairs）：5 个 non-improving pairs 是 HIGH-resource\n850\t    languages（如 Qwen3-zh, Qwen3-nl）on shallow layers where ZS transfer 已经接近 ceiling。\n851\t\n852\t    '\n853\t  tables:\n854\t  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect'\n855\t    columns:\n856\t    - beta\n857\t    - mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n858\t    - mean_delta_ece_pp\n859\t    - note\n860\t    rows:\n861\t    - - 0.0\n862\t      - 0.0\n863\t      - 0.0\n864\t      - baseline (BCE only)\n865\t    - - 0.001\n866\t      - 0.5\n867\t      - -0.3\n868\t      - marginal improvement\n869\t    - - 0.01\n870\t      - 1.8\n871\t      - -1.1\n872\t      - clear positive signal\n873\t    - - 0.05\n874\t      - 3.5\n875\t      - -2.4\n876\t      - optimal — best tradeoff\n877\t    - - 0.1\n878\t      - 3.2\n879\t      - -2.0\n880\t      - slight over-regularization\n881\t    - - 1.0\n882\t      - 0.8\n883\t      - -0.5\n884\t      - MMD dominates, probe accuracy degrades\n885\t  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at best-transfer layer, both models averaged)'\n886\t    columns:\n887\t    - method\n888\t    - auroc_mean_20\n889\t    - ece_mean_20\n890\t    - requires_labels\n891\t    - key_resource\n892\t    rows:\n893\t    - - zero-shot\n894\t      - 0.71\n895\t      - 0.118\n896\t      - none\n897\t      - —\n898\t    - - mean-shift\n899\t      - 0.71\n900\t      - 0.118\n901\t      - none\n902\t      - —\n903\t    - - linear_proj_50\n904\t      - 0.725\n905\t      - 0.098\n906\t      - 50 parallel pairs\n907\t      - Procrustes\n908\t    - - linear_proj_200\n909\t      - 0.729\n910\t      - 0.095\n911\t      - 200 parallel pairs\n912\t      - Procrustes\n913\t    - - few-shot-25\n914\t      - 0.7\n915\t      - 0.102\n916\t      - 25 labeled\n917\t      - target labels\n918\t    - - few-shot-100\n919\t      - 0.727\n920\t      - 0.088\n921\t      - 100 labeled\n922\t      - target labels\n923\t    - - CaCLR\n924\t      - 0.745\n925\t      - 0.082\n926\t      - none\n927\t      - parallel activations\n928\t  - name: 'Table 12: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, ZS AUROC vs CaCLR AUROC)'\n929\t    columns:\n930\t    - depth_pct\n931\t    - zs_auroc\n932\t    - caclr_auroc\n933\t    - delta_pp\n934\t    rows:\n935\t    - - 30\n936\t      - 0.733\n937\t      - 0.745\n938\t      - 1.2\n939\t    - - 43\n940\t      - 0.748\n941\t      - 0.766\n942\t      - 1.8\n943\t    - - 55\n944\t      - 0.72\n945\t      - 0.752\n946\t      - 3.2\n947\t    - - 64\n948\t      - 0.69\n949\t      - 0.738\n950\t      - 4.8\n951\t    - - 77\n952\t      - 0.638\n953\t      - 0.688\n954\t      - 5.0\n955\t    - - 85\n956\t      - 0.601\n957\t      - 0.641\n958\t      - 4.0\n959\t  figures_description:\n960\t  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x), inverted-U shape peaking\n961\t    at β=0.05. Inset shows corresponding ECE improvement.\n962\t\n963\t    '\n964\t  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile — ZS (blue) vs CaCLR (red) AUROC across normalized\n965\t    depth. Gap widens at deep layers, demonstrating CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer\n966\t    transfer degradation.\n967\t\n968\t    '\n969\t  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 在 deep layers 上提供 ≥2pp AUROC improvement（实际 deep-layer\n970\t    mean = +4.8pp），且 β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现最优区间。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency\n971\t    是主要 contributor（+2.8pp），L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration improvement（+0.7pp\n972\t    ECE, +0.7pp AUROC synergy）。\n973\t\n974\t    CaCLR 超越 linear projection 1.5pp 是因为 end-to-end 优化可以利用 training dynamics（gradient\n975\t    信号引导 probe 朝 language-invariant direction 收敛），而 Procrustes 只做 post-hoc geometric\n976\t    correction。但差距不大 是因为 1-D MMD 的 expressiveness 有限——它只能匹配 scalar logit distributions，不能做\n977\t    full subspace alignment。\n978\t\n979\t    Deep-layer improvement 模式与 Claim 2 的 decomposition 一致：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n980\t    component 更大，CaCLR 的 consistency loss 正好 在这些 layers 有更多 signal 来 exploit。这构成 Pareto→Decomposition→CaCLR→CKA\n981\t    因果链的第三环。\n982\t\n983\t    '\n984\t- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n985\t  plan_id: plan_004\n986\t  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression), project out difficulty direction,\n987\t    retrain correctness probes on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH:\n988\t    zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr, LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。包含\n989\t    random-direction control。\n990\t\n991\t    '\n992\t  expected_results:\n993\t    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.68\n994\t    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n995\t    - 0.55\n996\t    - 0.78\n997\t    difficulty_var_explained_pct: 65\n998\t    capability_var_explained_pct: 35\n999\t    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 12\n1000\t    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 88\n1001\t    decomp_capability_delta_auroc: 0.03\n1002\t    residual_en_auroc_drop_pp: 4.5\n1003\t    residual_zs_transfer_drop_pp: 0.8\n1004\t    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.2\n1005\t    prescriptive_accuracy: 0.78\n1006\t    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n1007\t      20pct: 0.6\n1008\t      50pct: 2.8\n1009\t      80pct: 8.5\n1010\t  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n1011\t    hard everywhere。Ridge regression captures this linearly (R²=0.68, 与 Civelli et\n1012\t    al. 的 shared difficulty finding 一致)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 65% 但仅贡献\n1013\t    12% 的 transfer degradation， 因为 difficulty signal 本质上是 universal 的。Capability-specific\n1014\t    residual 仅占 35% variance 但驱动 88% 的 transfer degradation，且 degradation 随 depth\n1015\t    指数增长（20% depth: 0.6pp → 80% depth: 8.5pp）。\n1016\t\n1017\t    这一 decomposition 解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic origin： deep layers 的 EN probe\n1018\t    improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent competence），而这个\n1019\t    component 恰好是 最难 transfer 的。CaCLR 的 consistency loss works precisely because it\n1020\t    targets this component。\n1021\t\n1022\t    Random-direction control（-1.2pp, 随机方向 projection 反而损害）确认 difficulty direction\n1023\t    不是 arbitrary dimensionality reduction 的 artifact， 而是 genuine signal。\n1024\t\n1025\t    Prescriptive accuracy 78%：给定语言-layer 的 difficulty/capability ratio，预测应使用 zero-shot（difficulty-dominant）还是\n1026\t    CaCLR （capability-dominant）策略，在 78% 的 cases 中正确。\n1027\t\n1028\t    '\n1029\t  tables:\n1030\t  - name: 'Table 13: Decomposition Results'\n1031\t    columns:\n1032\t    - component\n1033\t    - var_pct\n1034\t    - transfer_auroc_mean\n1035\t    - transfer_drop_pp\n1036\t    - degradation_share_pct\n1037\t    rows:\n1038\t    - - full_correctness\n1039\t      - 100\n1040\t      - 0.71\n1041\t      - 9.0\n1042\t      - 100\n1043\t    - - difficulty_shared\n1044\t      - 65\n1045\t      - 0.698\n1046\t      - 1.1\n1047\t      - 12\n1048\t    - - capability_specific\n1049\t      - 35\n1050\t      - 0.615\n1051\t      - 12.8\n1052\t      - 88\n1053\t  - name: 'Table 14: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth'\n1054\t    columns:\n1055\t    - depth_band\n1056\t    - difficulty_drop_pp\n1057\t    - capability_drop_pp\n1058\t    - ratio\n1059\t    rows:\n1060\t    - - 20-30%\n1061\t      - 0.2\n1062\t      - 0.6\n1063\t      - 3×\n1064\t    - - 40-50%\n1065\t      - 0.6\n1066\t      - 2.8\n1067\t      - 4.7×\n1068\t    - - 60-70%\n1069\t      - 1.0\n1070\t      - 5.6\n1071\t      - 5.6×\n1072\t    - - 75-90%\n1073\t      - 1.5\n1074\t      - 8.5\n1075\t      - 5.7×\n1076\t  figures_description:\n1077\t  - 'Figure 7: Stacked area — difficulty (blue, flat) vs capability (red, exponentially\n1078\t    increasing) transfer degradation across depth.\n1079\t\n1080\t    '\n1081\t  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。 Difficulty\n1082\t    占大部分 variance 但 near-perfectly transfers（仅 12% degradation share），capability 占少数但驱动几乎所有\n1083\t    degradation。 这解释了为何 zero-shot transfer 在 mid-depth 工作（difficulty dominates there）但在\n1084\t    deep layers 失败（capability grows）。 Prescriptive accuracy 78% 证实 decomposition 不仅是描述性的，\n1085\t    而是可以指导 alignment strategy selection。\n1086\t\n1087\t    '\n1088\t- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n1089\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1090\t  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n1091\t    Both models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定最小数据需求 和 resource-tier\n1092\t    分层饱和。\n1093\t\n1094\t    '\n1095\t  expected_results:\n1096\t    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 42\n1097\t    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n1098\t    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 38\n1099\t    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n1100\t    pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.72\n1101\t    pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.86\n1102\t    pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n1103\t    pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n1104\t    pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n1105\t    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.729\n1106\t    procrustes_reversal_threshold: 0.52\n1107\t    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 3.8\n1108\t    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.2\n1109\t  result_rationale: 'Linear projection (Procrustes) 学习 EN→target 的 rotation matrix。\n1110\t    20 pairs 即可估计 dominant rotational components（correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional\n1111\t    的，前几个 principal angles 解释 90%+ 的 alignment structure）。42 pairs 达到 95% 因为边际的 minor\n1112\t    components 需要更多 data 来稳定估计。\n1113\t\n1114\t    Resource-tier stratification 清晰：HIGH languages（zh/es/de 等）的 activation distributions\n1115\t    与 EN 更相似，rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低（fewer parameters to estimate），22\n1116\t    pairs 即可。LOW languages 需要估计更 complex rotation（effective rank 更高），48 pairs。\n1117\t\n1118\t    Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52）：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52 时， correctness direction\n1119\t    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 纠正旋转带来 +3.8pp。 当 ZS AUROC > 0.60 时，directions 已经 well-aligned，Procrustes\n1120\t    引入 estimation noise 反而 hurt -1.2pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35 （与 plan_011 的 cliff\n1121\t    threshold 一致）。\n1122\t\n1123\t    这一 finding 直接 actionable：practitioners 应先测 ZS transfer， only apply Procrustes\n1124\t    when baseline < 0.52。\n1125\t\n1126\t    '\n1127\t  tables:\n1128\t  - name: 'Table 15: Projection Sample Efficiency'\n1129\t    columns:\n1130\t    - n_pairs\n1131\t    - pct_of_200pair_performance\n1132\t    - mean_auroc\n1133\t    - note\n1134\t    rows:\n1135\t    - - 10\n1136\t      - 72\n1137\t      - 0.724\n1138\t      - unstable, high variance across runs\n1139\t    - - 20\n1140\t      - 86\n1141\t      - 0.728\n1142\t      - captures dominant rotation\n1143\t    - - 30\n1144\t      - 92\n1145\t      - 0.731\n1146\t      - near plateau for HIGH langs\n1147\t    - - 50\n1148\t      - 97\n1149\t      - 0.734\n1150\t      - near plateau for all tiers\n1151\t    - - 100\n1152\t      - 99\n1153\t      - 0.737\n1154\t      - marginal returns\n1155\t    - - 200\n1156\t      - 100\n1157\t      - 0.729\n1158\t      - baseline (reference)\n1159\t  - name: 'Table 16: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n1160\t    columns:\n1161\t    - tier\n1162\t    - pairs_to_90pct\n1163\t    - pairs_to_95pct\n1164\t    - interpretation\n1165\t    rows:\n1166\t    - - HIGH\n1167\t      - 15\n1168\t      - 22\n1169\t      - rotation is simple, low effective rank\n1170\t    - - MID\n1171\t      - 25\n1172\t      - 38\n1173\t      - moderate rotation complexity\n1174\t    - - LOW\n1175\t      - 35\n1176\t      - 48\n1177\t      - complex rotation, more data needed\n1178\t  - name: 'Table 17: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n1179\t    columns:\n1180\t    - zs_auroc_range\n1181\t    - n_lang_layer_pairs\n1182\t    - mean_delta_pp\n1183\t    - direction\n1184\t    rows:\n1185\t    - - <0.45\n1186\t      - 42\n1187\t      - 5.2\n1188\t      - strong positive\n1189\t    - - 0.45-0.52\n1190\t      - 68\n1191\t      - 2.4\n1192\t      - moderate positive\n1193\t    - - 0.52-0.60\n1194\t      - 95\n1195\t      - 0.3\n1196\t      - near-zero (transition zone)\n1197\t    - - 0.60-0.70\n1198\t      - 88\n1199\t      - -1.2\n1200\t      - negative — hurts\n1201\t    - - '>0.70'\n1202\t      - 47\n1203\t      - -0.8\n1204\t      - slight negative\n1205\t  figures_description:\n1206\t  - 'Figure 8a: Sample efficiency curves — AUROC (y) vs n_pairs (x), three curves\n1207\t    for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers, showing staggered saturation.\n1208\t\n1209\t    '\n1210\t  - 'Figure 8b: Procrustes effect reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline AUROC\n1211\t    (x), showing sign change at ~0.52. Dot size proportional to sample count.\n1212\t\n1213\t    '\n1214\t  analysis: '~42 pairs to 95% performance 是 directly actionable 的 practical finding：对于大多数语言，仅需\n1215\t    <50 parallel sentences 即可达到接近 supervised-level alignment。Resource-tier stratification（HIGH\n1216\t    22 vs LOW 48 pairs）提供了 per-language guidance。\n1217\t\n1218\t    Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35 形成对应： CKA < 0.35 的 language-layer\n1219\t    combinations 对应 ZS < 0.52（ 因为 poor alignment → poor transfer），正好是 Procrustes 帮助最大的\n1220\t    区域。这构成了 geometric explanation 的 practical corollary。\n1221\t\n1222\t    '\n1223\t- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n1224\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1225\t  description: 'Extend MVP English-only control task analysis to 20 languages × 2\n1226\t    architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted labels, compute selectivity =\n1227\t    real_AUROC - control_AUROC。Identify capacity artifacts by language, layer, and\n1228\t    model。\n1229\t\n1230\t    '\n1231\t  expected_results:\n1232\t    en_selectivity_range:\n1233\t    - 0.02\n1234\t    - 0.26\n1235\t    en_selectivity_meaningful_layers:\n1236\t    - 16\n1237\t    - 20\n1238\t    - 24\n1239\t    - 27\n1240\t    control_artifact_rate_lowres: 0.27\n1241\t    control_artifact_rate_midres: 0.05\n1242\t    control_artifact_rate_highres: 0.03\n1243\t    low_res_langs_most_affected:\n1244\t    - yo\n1245\t    - ig\n1246\t    - te\n1247\t    - sw\n1248\t    artifact_concentration_depth: 60-100% depth\n1249\t    cross_lingual_selectivity_mean:\n1250\t      HIGH: 0.22\n1251\t      MID: 0.18\n1252\t      LOW: 0.09\n1253\t    languages_with_any_meaningful_selectivity: 17\n1254\t    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.495\n1255\t    control_auroc_std: 0.008\n1256\t  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262）确立了 baseline。Cross-lingual\n1257\t    extension 揭示了 resource-tier dependent artifact pattern：\n1258\t\n1259\t    LOW-resource languages 的 27% artifact rate 源于两个因素：(1) these languages 在 model\n1260\t    pretraining 中占比极低，activation distributions 相对 high-resource 更 \"shallow\" (less\n1261\t    structured)，linear probes 更容易 通过 capacity 而非 genuine signal 拟合少量 patterns；(2)\n1262\t    GlobalMMLU 的 low-resource translations 质量较低，引入 noise 使 correctness signal 更弱，selectivity\n1263\t    更接近 chance。\n1264\t\n1265\t    Mid/high-resource 的 artifact rate 极低（3-5%）因为 representation quality 高，probe 有\n1266\t    genuine signal 可以 leverage。\n1267\t\n1268\t    Artifacts 集中在 60-100% depth，与 CKA cliff 一致：deep layers 的 low-resource CKA 已经很低（<0.2），cross-lingual\n1269\t    activation structure 不足以支撑 genuine correctness probing，probe 退化为 memorizing dataset-specific\n1270\t    patterns。\n1271\t\n1272\t    这一 finding 是 field-level contribution：此前没有人在 cross-lingual probing 中检查 selectivity\n1273\t    controls。28% 的 low-resource artifact rate 意味着没有 control tasks 的 cross-lingual\n1274\t    probing 结果 （包括 Xiao et al.）需要谨慎解读。\n1275\t\n1276\t    '\n1277\t  tables:\n1278\t  - name: 'Table 18: Selectivity by Resource Tier and Depth'\n1279\t    columns:\n1280\t    - depth_band\n1281\t    - HIGH_selectivity\n1282\t    - MID_selectivity\n1283\t    - LOW_selectivity\n1284\t    rows:\n1285\t    - - 0-30%\n1286\t      - 0.04\n1287\t      - 0.03\n1288\t      - 0.01\n1289\t    - - 30-60%\n1290\t      - 0.18\n1291\t      - 0.14\n1292\t      - 0.06\n1293\t    - - 60-80%\n1294\t      - 0.28\n1295\t      - 0.22\n1296\t      - 0.1\n1297\t    - - 80-100%\n1298\t      - 0.25\n1299\t      - 0.2\n1300\t      - 0.08\n1301\t  - name: 'Table 19: Artifact Rates by Tier'\n1302\t    columns:\n1303\t    - tier\n1304\t    - n_lang_layer_combinations\n1305\t    - artifact_count\n1306\t    - artifact_rate\n1307\t    rows:\n1308\t    - - HIGH\n1309\t      - 384\n1310\t      - 12\n1311\t      - 3%\n1312\t    - - MID\n1313\t      - 336\n1314\t      - 17\n1315\t      - 5%\n1316\t    - - LOW\n1317\t      - 240\n1318\t      - 65\n1319\t      - 27%\n1320\t    - - total\n1321\t      - 960\n1322\t      - 94\n1323\t      - 10%\n1324\t  figures_description:\n1325\t  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap — language (y, ordered by tier) × depth (x). LOW-resource\n1326\t    rows show gray (low selectivity) at deep layers.\n1327\t\n1328\t    '\n1329\t  analysis: '27% low-resource artifact rate 是 methodological warning for the field：\n1330\t    cross-lingual probing studies 如果不做 selectivity checks 会高估 low-resource transfer\n1331\t    quality。重要的是 artifacts 集中在 low-resource + deep layers，不波及 mid/high-resource 或\n1332\t    shallow layers，因此本文的 核心 Pareto/CKA 分析（主要基于 mid/high-resource patterns）不受影响。\n1333\t\n1334\t    '\n1335\t- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n1336\t  plan_id: plan_005\n1337\t  description: 'Extract verbalized confidence direction, compute cosine similarity\n1338\t    with correctness direction, 20 languages × 2 architectures。 Supporting evidence\n1339\t    for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n1340\t\n1341\t    '\n1342\t  expected_results:\n1343\t    cosine_mean_overall: 0.05\n1344\t    cosine_range:\n1345\t    - 0.02\n1346\t    - 0.09\n1347\t    cosine_en: 0.03\n1348\t    all_below_0p10: true\n1349\t    qwen3_cosine_mean: 0.046\n1350\t    llama4_cosine_mean: 0.054\n1351\t    HIGH_cosine_mean: 0.038\n1352\t    MID_cosine_mean: 0.052\n1353\t    LOW_cosine_mean: 0.072\n1354\t    resource_tier_correlation: -0.66\n1355\t  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 上测得 cosine < 0.04。Extension\n1356\t    to 20 languages × 大模型应保持 near-orthogonality（< 0.10），因为这反映 transformer 的 structural\n1357\t    property：verbalized confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level token\n1358\t    probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码，两者 architecturally\n1359\t    decoupled。Low-resource 略高（0.072 mean）因为 confidence elicitation in low-resource\n1360\t    languages 更 noisy，不完全 decoupled。Resource-tier gradient（r=-0.66）说明更好的 multilingual\n1361\t    training → 更清晰的 correctness/confidence separation。\n1362\t\n1363\t    '\n1364\t  tables:\n1365\t  - name: 'Table 20: Orthogonality by Tier (cosine similarity)'\n1366\t    columns:\n1367\t    - tier\n1368\t    - n_langs\n1369\t    - qwen3_mean\n1370\t    - llama4_mean\n1371\t    - combined_mean\n1372\t    rows:\n1373\t    - - HIGH\n1374\t      - 8\n1375\t      - 0.035\n1376\t      - 0.041\n1377\t      - 0.038\n1378\t    - - MID\n1379\t      - 7\n1380\t      - 0.048\n1381\t      - 0.056\n1382\t      - 0.052\n1383\t    - - LOW\n1384\t      - 5\n1385\t      - 0.066\n1386\t      - 0.078\n1387\t      - 0.072\n1388\t  figures_description:\n1389\t  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier, all below 0.10 threshold\n1390\t    line.\n1391\t\n1392\t    '\n1393\t  analysis: 'Orthogonality universally holds (39/40 pairs below 0.10, all 40 below\n1394\t    0.095)，confirming output-based calibration methods are structurally limited across\n1395\t    languages。Resource-tier gradient 是新 finding，但 effect size 小（range only 0.034），作为\n1396\t    subsection 足够。\n1397\t\n1398\t    '\n1399\t- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n1400\t  plan_id: plan_006\n1401\t  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP at each probed layer, both models。\n1402\t    Validates linear probe choice for transfer。\n1403\t\n1404\t    '\n1405\t  expected_results:\n1406\t    logreg_en_auroc_best: 0.81\n1407\t    mlp_en_auroc_best: 0.83\n1408\t    mlp_en_gain_pp: 2.0\n1409\t    logreg_zs_drop_mean_pp: 9.0\n1410\t    mlp_zs_drop_mean_pp: 14.5\n1411\t    logreg_transfer_advantage_pp: 5.5\n1412\t    logreg_advantage_shallow_pp: 2.0\n1413\t    logreg_advantage_deep_pp: 8.2\n1414\t  result_rationale: 'Linear probes learn 一个 hyperplane，跨语言泛化因为 correctness subspace\n1415\t    是 near-universal linear structure（subspace angle ~12° from plan_011）。 MLPs fit\n1416\t    nonlinear decision boundaries that overfit EN-specific feature interactions，gaining\n1417\t    +2pp EN AUROC but losing 5.5pp transfer。Gap 在 deep layers 放大（+8.2pp advantage\n1418\t    for logreg at 80% depth）因为 deep layers 有更多 language-specific nonlinear structure\n1419\t    for MLP to exploit。 This justifies logreg as primary probe and supports geometric\n1420\t    interpretation of Pareto frontier。\n1421\t\n1422\t    '\n1423\t  tables:\n1424\t  - name: 'Table S2: Probe Complexity (Qwen3, at EN-optimal layer)'\n1425\t    columns:\n1426\t    - probe_type\n1427\t    - en_auroc\n1428\t    - zs_mean_20\n1429\t    - zs_drop_pp\n1430\t    rows:\n1431\t    - - logistic_regression\n1432\t      - 0.81\n1433\t      - 0.72\n1434\t      - 9.0\n1435\t    - - mlp_2layer_h128\n1436\t      - 0.83\n1437\t      - 0.685\n1438\t      - 14.5\n1439\t  figures_description:\n1440\t  - 'Figure S3: Transfer drop (pp) vs depth, logreg (blue) vs MLP (red). MLP diverges\n1441\t    sharply past 60% depth.\n1442\t\n1443\t    '\n1444\t  analysis: 'Linear probes 为 cross-lingual transfer 的 optimal choice：牺牲 2pp EN performance\n1445\t    换取 5.5pp transfer improvement。Depth interaction confirms nonlinear language-specific\n1446\t    features drive deep-layer degradation。\n1447\t\n1448\t    '\n1449\t- name: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n1450\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1451\t  description: 'Evaluate best probes + CaCLR on Belebele and MMLU-ProX (20 languages\n1452\t    each)。Tests domain generalization。\n1453\t\n1454\t    '\n1455\t  expected_results:\n1456\t    belebele_zs_mean_20: 0.695\n1457\t    belebele_caclr_mean_20: 0.728\n1458\t    belebele_caclr_delta_pp: 3.3\n1459\t    mmlupx_zs_mean_20: 0.68\n1460\t    mmlupx_caclr_mean_20: 0.715\n1461\t    mmlupx_caclr_delta_pp: 3.5\n1462\t    cross_benchmark_caclr_cv: 0.04\n1463\t  result_rationale: 'Belebele (reading comprehension) 和 MMLU-ProX (harder factual)\n1464\t    的 baseline 略低于 GlobalMMLU 因为 domain shift，但 CaCLR 的 improvement 幅度 consistent（3.3-3.5pp\n1465\t    vs GlobalMMLU 的 3.5pp）。Low CV (0.04) 证实 CaCLR addresses 一个 fundamental representation\n1466\t    alignment issue 而非 overfitting to specific benchmark。\n1467\t\n1468\t    '\n1469\t  tables:\n1470\t  - name: 'Table 21: Cross-Benchmark CaCLR Generalization'\n1471\t    columns:\n1472\t    - benchmark\n1473\t    - zs_mean_20\n1474\t    - caclr_mean_20\n1475\t    - delta_pp\n1476\t    rows:\n1477\t    - - GlobalMMLU\n1478\t      - 0.71\n1479\t      - 0.745\n1480\t      - 3.5\n1481\t    - - Belebele\n1482\t      - 0.695\n1483\t      - 0.728\n1484\t      - 3.3\n1485\t    - - MMLU-ProX\n1486\t      - 0.68\n1487\t      - 0.715\n1488\t      - 3.5\n1489\t  figures_description:\n1490\t  - 'Figure S4: CaCLR improvement by benchmark × language, showing consistent gains.\n1491\t\n1492\t    '\n1493\t  analysis: 'CaCLR generalizes across benchmarks with low variance。Cross-benchmark\n1494\t    consistency is the strongest defense against overfitting concerns。\n1495\t\n1496\t    '\n1497\t- name: Quantization Validation Ablation\n1498\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1499\t  description: '(a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset; (b) GPTQ-Int4\n1500\t    vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset。\n1501\t\n1502\t    '\n1503\t  expected_results:\n1504\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.3\n1505\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 0.8\n1506\t    llama4_rank_correlation: 0.996\n1507\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.5\n1508\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 1.1\n1509\t    qwen3_rank_correlation: 0.994\n1510\t    conclusion: quantization introduces negligible distortion for probing\n1511\t  result_rationale: 'W4A16 (Llama4) 保留 16-bit activations，仅 weight 量化，对 activation\n1512\t    geometry 影响极小（0.3pp mean diff）。GPTQ-Int4 (Qwen3) 更 aggressive 但 correctness direction\n1513\t    的 angular structure 仍 robust（0.5pp mean diff）， 因为 quantization noise 近似 isotropic，不\n1514\t    preferentially distort correctness-relevant directions。Rank correlation > 0.994\n1515\t    确认 Pareto frontier ordering 完全保留。Qwen3 的 slightly higher diff (0.5 vs 0.3) 因为\n1516\t    Int4 比 W4A16 更 lossy。\n1517\t\n1518\t    '\n1519\t  tables:\n1520\t  - name: 'Table S3: Quantization Comparison (5 representative layers)'\n1521\t    columns:\n1522\t    - model\n1523\t    - layer\n1524\t    - fp16_auroc\n1525\t    - quant_auroc\n1526\t    - diff_pp\n1527\t    rows:\n1528\t    - - Llama4\n1529\t      - 8\n1530\t      - 0.637\n1531\t      - 0.634\n1532\t      - 0.3\n1533\t    - - Llama4\n1534\t      - 16\n1535\t      - 0.737\n1536\t      - 0.735\n1537\t      - 0.2\n1538\t    - - Llama4\n1539\t      - 28\n1540\t      - 0.784\n1541\t      - 0.781\n1542\t      - 0.3\n1543\t    - - Llama4\n1544\t      - 36\n1545\t      - 0.792\n1546\t      - 0.789\n1547\t      - 0.3\n1548\t    - - Llama4\n1549\t      - 44\n1550\t      - 0.774\n1551\t      - 0.77\n1552\t      - 0.4\n1553\t    - - Qwen3\n1554\t      - 20\n1555\t      - 0.712\n1556\t      - 0.708\n1557\t      - 0.4\n1558\t    - - Qwen3\n1559\t      - 36\n1560\t      - 0.78\n1561\t      - 0.775\n1562\t      - 0.5\n1563\t    - - Qwen3\n1564\t      - 52\n1565\t      - 0.808\n1566\t      - 0.803\n1567\t      - 0.5\n1568\t    - - Qwen3\n1569\t      - 68\n1570\t      - 0.812\n1571\t      - 0.806\n1572\t      - 0.6\n1573\t    - - Qwen3\n1574\t      - 80\n1575\t      - 0.807\n1576\t      - 0.8\n1577\t      - 0.7\n1578\t  figures_description:\n1579\t  - 'Figure S5: Quant vs FP16 scatter, y=x diagonal, tight clustering.\n1580\t\n1581\t    '\n1582\t  analysis: 'Quantization safe for both models。Preempts reviewer concern #5。\n1583\t\n1584\t    '\n1585\t- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture (Camera-Ready)\n1586\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1587\t  description: 'Full Pareto frontier on Gemma 4 31B Dense (60 layers, FP16), 20 languages。Provides\n1588\t    dense vs MoE contrast for camera-ready。\n1589\t\n1590\t    '\n1591\t  expected_results:\n1592\t    en_best_auroc: 0.8\n1593\t    en_best_layer_idx: 45\n1594\t    zs_mean_20lang: 0.71\n1595\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 36\n1596\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.85\n1597\t    per_lang_rho_median: -0.58\n1598\t    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.0\n1599\t    simpson_partial_rho: 0.44\n1600\t    simpson_partial_p: 0.004\n1601\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma 4 31B Dense 是理想的第三 data point：dense architecture（vs two\n1602\t    MoE models），different pretraining recipe（Google vs Alibaba/Meta）， 60 layers（between\n1603\t    Qwen 94 and Llama 48）。EN AUROC 0.80 低于 MoE models 因为 31B dense < 22B MoE active\n1604\t    (MoE routing 提供 effective capacity boost)。Pareto strength (ρ=-0.85) 介于 Qwen (-0.91)\n1605\t    和 Llama (-0.78) 之间。Simpson''s partial correlation 仍然显著 (rho=+0.44, p=0.004)， 确认\n1606\t    geometric insight 是 architecture-universal 而非 MoE-specific。\n1607\t\n1608\t    '\n1609\t  tables:\n1610\t  - name: 'Table 22: Three-Architecture Summary'\n1611\t    columns:\n1612\t    - model\n1613\t    - type\n1614\t    - layers\n1615\t    - en_best\n1616\t    - zs_mean_20\n1617\t    - pareto_rho\n1618\t    - simpson_partial_rho\n1619\t    - caclr_delta_pp\n1620\t    rows:\n1621\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n1622\t      - MoE\n1623\t      - 94\n1624\t      - 0.81\n1625\t      - 0.72\n1626\t      - -0.91\n1627\t      - 0.48\n1628\t      - 3.7\n1629\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n1630\t      - MoE\n1631\t      - 48\n1632\t      - 0.79\n1633\t      - 0.7\n1634\t      - -0.78\n1635\t      - 0.41\n1636\t      - 3.3\n1637\t    - - Gemma4 31B\n1638\t      - Dense\n1639\t      - 60\n1640\t      - 0.8\n1641\t      - 0.71\n1642\t      - -0.85\n1643\t      - 0.44\n1644\t      - 3.0\n1645\t  figures_description:\n1646\t  - 'Figure 9: Three-architecture Pareto frontiers overlaid (normalized depth %).\n1647\t    Remarkably similar shapes.\n1648\t\n1649\t    '\n1650\t  analysis: 'Three-architecture replication 是 universality claim 最强证据： Simpson''s\n1651\t    Paradox 在 dense 和 MoE 上都成立，Pareto frontier 在 55-60% depth 处一致出现 knee，CaCLR 提供\n1652\t    3-3.7pp consistent gain。 Dense vs MoE 的差异 minimal — phenomenon 是 transformer depth\n1653\t    的 property 而非 routing architecture 的。\n1654\t\n1655\t    '\n1656\t- name: Extended Language Coverage (Camera-Ready)\n1657\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1658\t  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready。\n1659\t\n1660\t    '\n1661\t  expected_results:\n1662\t    total_languages: 50\n1663\t    zs_pass_rate_50lang: 0.84\n1664\t    zs_auroc_above_060_count: 42\n1665\t    caclr_improvement_positive_count: 47\n1666\t    mean_zs_auroc_50lang: 0.69\n1667\t    mean_caclr_auroc_50lang: 0.72\n1668\t    pareto_frontier_holds_all_langs: true\n1669\t    new_families:\n1670\t    - Austronesian\n1671\t    - Dravidian\n1672\t    - Uralic\n1673\t    - Kartvelian\n1674\t    - Niger-Congo_B\n1675\t  result_rationale: 'Expansion 主要增加 mid-resource 语言（Indonesian, Finnish, Georgian,\n1676\t    Tamil, Telugu, etc.），大多 fall in 0.65-0.75 AUROC range。Extremely low-resource 语言（Amharic,\n1677\t    Khmer, Lao）可能 < 0.55 但代表 edge cases。 CaCLR 在 94% 的新增语言上 positive 因为 consistency\n1678\t    loss mechanism 是 language-agnostic。Pareto frontier structure 在 50 languages 上\n1679\t    完全保持。\n1680\t\n1681\t    '\n1682\t  tables:\n1683\t  - name: 'Table 23: Extended Coverage by Tier'\n1684\t    columns:\n1685\t    - tier\n1686\t    - n_langs\n1687\t    - zs_mean\n1688\t    - caclr_mean\n1689\t    - caclr_gain_pp\n1690\t    rows:\n1691\t    - - HIGH\n1692\t      - 10\n1693\t      - 0.75\n1694\t      - 0.78\n1695\t      - 2.8\n1696\t    - - MID\n1697\t      - 24\n1698\t      - 0.71\n1699\t      - 0.74\n1700\t      - 3.5\n1701\t    - - LOW\n1702\t      - 12\n1703\t      - 0.62\n1704\t      - 0.66\n1705\t      - 4.2\n1706\t    - - VERY_LOW\n1707\t      - 4\n1708\t      - 0.53\n1709\t      - 0.58\n1710\t      - 5.0\n1711\t  figures_description:\n1712\t  - 'Figure 10: World map with per-language CaCLR AUROC, colored by performance tier.\n1713\t    Broad geographic/typological coverage.\n1714\t\n1715\t    '\n1716\t  analysis: 50-language extension 确认 all findings at scale。Resource-tier gradient\n1717\t    smooth, CaCLR benefit inversely correlated with resource level, no language family\n1718\t    shows anomalous behavior。\n1719\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f5eee182-64f0-49d7-8928-961587304e5d","uuid":"7602f47e-f70e-4176-ab0d-d0f246d46397","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:27:14.350Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044911/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: best\nnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。以 Simpson''s Paradox 几何洞见为核心新颖性开篇—— raw CKA-transfer\n  correlation 为负（depth confound），partial correlation controlling for depth 在双架构上均显著为正（p\n  < 0.01），揭示 within-layer CKA genuinely predicts transfer quality。CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献（+3.5pp\n  mean over ZS），不是 headline 但 构成因果链第三环。标题强调 ''geometric analysis reveals when and\n  why cross-lingual calibration transfer succeeds''。四条 claim 完整因果链保留：Pareto discovery（architecture-\n  dependent depth-transferability tradeoff）→ Decomposition analysis（difficulty vs\n  capability separation）→ CaCLR method（consistency loss provides measurable gain at\n  deep layers）→ CKA geometric explanation（Simpson''s Paradox, subspace persistence）。\n  Control task warning（28% low-resource artifacts）和 linear projection sample efficiency\n  （~42 pairs to 95%）作为加分实证贡献。Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52） 为 practitioner\n  提供直接指导。无需弱化任何 claims。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '94-layer MoE (INT4, ~22B active), 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20\n    typologically diverse languages, English logistic regression probes, 5 transfer\n    conditions: zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection (200 pairs), few-shot 25/100,\n    CaCLR。重点验证 MVP 发现的 strong depth-transferability tradeoff 是否在大模型上保持。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.81\n    en_best_layer_idx: 72\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.58\n    - 0.81\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.168\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.72\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 52\n    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.9\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.76\n      MID_mean: 0.72\n      LOW_mean: 0.63\n    zs_auroc_selected:\n      zh: 0.77\n      es: 0.76\n      fr: 0.76\n      de: 0.77\n      ja: 0.75\n      nl: 0.76\n      pt: 0.75\n      it: 0.75\n      ar: 0.73\n      hi: 0.71\n      ko: 0.72\n      tr: 0.71\n      ru: 0.74\n      vi: 0.7\n      th: 0.69\n      sw: 0.63\n      bn: 0.65\n      yo: 0.57\n      ig: 0.61\n      te: 0.58\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.64\n    per_lang_significant_at_005: 15\n    global_spearman_rho: -0.91\n    global_spearman_p: 0.0001\n    pareto_frontier_layers:\n    - 40\n    - 44\n    - 48\n    - 52\n    - 56\n    pareto_en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp: 4.2\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.74\n    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.708\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.735\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B 的 22B active params 比 MVP Qwen2.5-7B 多 3×，log-linear\n    probing scaling 预期 EN AUROC 从 0.754 提升至 ~0.81。94 层深网络使 depth-transferability tradeoff\n    比 28 层 MVP 更显著：EN-optimal layer (L72, 77% depth) 与 ZS-optimal layer (L52, 55%\n    depth) 之间有 20 层间隔（MVP 仅 3 层）。Strong Pareto 源于 Qwen 架构特征：MoE routing 在深层产生 language-specific\n    expert 激活模式， 导致 correctness direction 的 cross-lingual alignment 在 L60 后急剧下降。 15/20\n    languages 的 per-language Spearman rho 显著为负，表明 tradeoff 是 跨语言一致的。2 个 fail 语言（yo,\n    te）的 AUROC < 0.60 因为 Qwen3 pretraining corpus 中 Yoruba/Telugu 占比极低（<0.1%），embedding\n    层的 representation quality 即不足以支撑 correctness signal。Mean-shift ΔAUROC ≡ 0 因为 StandardScaler\n    + LR 下 mean-shift 对 AUROC 无影响（已在 MVP 中数学证明）。 Linear projection (200 pairs) 提供\n    +2pp 因为 Procrustes alignment 捕获了 correctness subspace 的旋转，但不触及 distributional\n    matching。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier (selected layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 4\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.572\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 13\n      - 0.645\n      - 0.632\n      - 1.3\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 21\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.695\n      - 1.5\n      - false\n    - - 28\n      - 30\n      - 0.752\n      - 0.733\n      - 1.9\n      - false\n    - - 36\n      - 38\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.752\n      - 2.6\n      - false\n    - - 40\n      - 43\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.748\n      - 4.0\n      - true\n    - - 44\n      - 47\n      - 0.796\n      - 0.74\n      - 5.6\n      - true\n    - - 48\n      - 51\n      - 0.802\n      - 0.732\n      - 7.0\n      - true\n    - - 52\n      - 55\n      - 0.806\n      - 0.72\n      - 8.6\n      - true\n    - - 56\n      - 60\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.706\n      - 10.2\n      - true\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.69\n      - 12.0\n      - false\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.661\n      - 14.9\n      - false\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.638\n      - 17.2\n      - false\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.805\n      - 0.601\n      - 20.4\n      - false\n    - - 88\n      - 94\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.558\n      - 23.4\n      - false\n    - - 92\n      - 98\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.531\n      - 24.7\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Language Spearman ρ (depth vs ZS AUROC), Qwen3'\n    columns:\n    - language\n    - tier\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - zh\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.72\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - es\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.68\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - fr\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.7\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - de\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.69\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - ja\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.74\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - nl\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - pt\n      - MID\n      - -0.65\n      - 0.004\n      - true\n    - - it\n      - MID\n      - -0.66\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - ar\n      - MID\n      - -0.71\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - hi\n      - MID\n      - -0.63\n      - 0.005\n      - true\n    - - ko\n      - MID\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - tr\n      - MID\n      - -0.62\n      - 0.006\n      - true\n    - - ru\n      - MID\n      - -0.69\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - vi\n      - MID\n      - -0.61\n      - 0.008\n      - true\n    - - th\n      - MID\n      - -0.58\n      - 0.012\n      - true\n    - - sw\n      - LOW\n      - -0.52\n      - 0.025\n      - true\n    - - bn\n      - LOW\n      - -0.55\n      - 0.018\n      - false\n    - - yo\n      - LOW\n      - -0.48\n      - 0.042\n      - false\n    - - ig\n      - LOW\n      - -0.51\n      - 0.028\n      - false\n    - - te\n      - LOW\n      - -0.45\n      - 0.058\n      - false\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1a: Pareto frontier scatter (EN AUROC x-axis vs ZS mean AUROC y-axis),\n    24 points, 5 Pareto-optimal layers marked red. Clear convex knee at ~55% depth.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered by resource tier)\n    × normalized depth (x-axis). Warm mid-band, low-resource rows cool earlier at\n    shallower depth than high-resource rows.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent depth-transferability tradeoff： global\n    Spearman ρ = -0.91 (p < 0.001), 15/20 per-language ρ 显著为负。 Pareto frontier 包含\n    5 层 (L40-L56)，knee 在 ~55% depth。EN-optimal (L72) 与 ZS-optimal (L52) 相隔 20 层 /\n    22pp depth，远大于 MVP 的 3 层 间隔。这证实 tradeoff 在大模型上不是减弱而是放大——更深的网络有更多 空间进行 language-specific\n    specialization。High-resource 语言在 Pareto knee 以下也保持 AUROC > 0.74，但 low-resource\n    在 70% depth 后急剧下降。 这与 CKA 分析一致：CKA 在 L60 后的 cliff 解释了为何 deep-layer transfer 对\n    low-resource 影响更大（CKA 基线更低，cliff 更早触及）。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n    4th), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak/mixed tradeoff\n    pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.79\n    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.56\n    - 0.79\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.182\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.7\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.85\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    - ig\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.74\n      MID_mean: 0.7\n      LOW_mean: 0.61\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n    per_lang_significant_at_005: 6\n    per_lang_positive_rho_langs:\n    - ar\n    - hi\n    - ko\n    global_spearman_rho: -0.78\n    global_spearman_p: 0.003\n    pareto_frontier_layers:\n    - 20\n    - 24\n    - 28\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.718\n    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.692\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.718\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak tradeoff 模式。虽然 global\n    Spearman ρ = -0.78 仍然显著（12 data points, p=0.003），但 per-language 分析揭示了明显的异质性：仅\n    6/20 languages 有显著负 ρ，而 ar/hi/ko 展现正 ρ（深层 transfer 反而改善）。这与 MVP 完全一致（ar/ko 在 L31\n    优于 L20），且可归因于 Llama 架构的 multilingual training recipe：Meta 的训练策略使 ar/hi/ko 在深层保持更好的\n    cross-lingual alignment，可能 因为这些语言在 pretraining 中与 English 有更多 code-switching 数据。\n    Global rho 仍然显著是因为大多数语言确实有弱负趋势，但 per-language 分析揭示这不是 universal pattern。与 Qwen3\n    的对比清晰：Qwen3 的 15/20 significant vs Llama4 的 6/20，median rho -0.64 vs -0.28。这一\n    architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 的核心发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 8\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.552\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n    - - 8\n      - 17\n      - 0.635\n      - 0.625\n      - 1.0\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 25\n      - 0.695\n      - 0.682\n      - 1.3\n      - false\n    - - 16\n      - 33\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.718\n      - 1.7\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 42\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.724\n      - 3.4\n      - true\n    - - 24\n      - 50\n      - 0.772\n      - 0.714\n      - 5.8\n      - true\n    - - 28\n      - 58\n      - 0.782\n      - 0.7\n      - 8.2\n      - true\n    - - 32\n      - 67\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.681\n      - 10.8\n      - false\n    - - 36\n      - 75\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.655\n      - 13.5\n      - false\n    - - 40\n      - 83\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.625\n      - 16.0\n      - false\n    - - 44\n      - 92\n      - 0.772\n      - 0.589\n      - 18.3\n      - false\n    - - 48\n      - 100\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.548\n      - 20.0\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 4: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen3_235B\n    - Llama4_Scout\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - global_rho\n      - -0.91\n      - -0.78\n      - both significant but Qwen stronger\n    - - per_lang_sig_count\n      - 15/20\n      - 6/20\n      - Qwen consistent, Llama mixed\n    - - median_per_lang_rho\n      - -0.64\n      - -0.28\n      - 2.3x difference in effect size\n    - - positive_rho_langs\n      - 0\n      - 3\n      - Llama has ar/hi/ko reversed\n    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n      - 55\n      - 58\n      - comparable location\n    - - en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp\n      - 4.2\n      - 3.4\n      - comparable magnitude\n  - name: 'Table 5: Transfer Conditions Comparison (both models, at best-transfer\n      layer)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - Qwen3_mean_20\n    - Llama4_mean_20\n    - combined_mean\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.71\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.71\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.729\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.708\n      - 0.692\n      - 0.7\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.727\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth), Qwen3 in blue, Llama4\n    in orange. Qwen3 shifted up-right with steeper descent; Llama4 flatter with more\n    scatter at deep layers.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution: Qwen3 (left) tightly clustered\n    around -0.65; Llama4 (right) spread from -0.50 to +0.35, ar/hi/ko clearly positive.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Architecture-dependent Pareto strength 是 Claim 1 的核心。两个架构的 global rho\n    都显著（满足 pareto_spearman_rho_significant_archs = 2 的 约束），但 effect size 差异明显。Qwen3\n    的 strong tradeoff 意味着 practitioner 必须在 EN accuracy 和 transfer quality 之间做明确选择；\n    Llama4 的 weak tradeoff 意味着某些语言（ar, hi, ko）可以 \"free-ride\" 深层的 EN improvement 而不牺牲\n    transfer。这一差异无法从 domain adaptation theory 预测——它是架构特有的 empirical finding。 Best-transfer\n    depth 在两个架构上收敛至 55-58%，暗示一个 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"，但 frontier 的 steepness\n    是 architecture-specific。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n    × 2 models。核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。验证\n    pilot finding 的 Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上双架构复现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.36\n    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n    llama4_raw_rho: -0.41\n    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n    qwen3_partial_p: 0.002\n    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.31\n    - 0.62\n    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n    llama4_partial_p: 0.008\n    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.57\n    simpson_paradox_confirmed_both_archs: true\n    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count: 18\n    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count: 6\n    llama4_per_layer_positive_count: 9\n    llama4_per_layer_significant_count: 3\n    qwen3_cka_peak_layer: 16\n    qwen3_cka_peak_value: 0.82\n    qwen3_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.28\n    qwen3_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 55\n    llama4_cka_peak_layer: 12\n    llama4_cka_peak_value: 0.84\n    llama4_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.35\n    llama4_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 50\n    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.58\n    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.72\n    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.4\n    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 38.7\n    correctness_direction_persists_despite_global_cka_decline: true\n  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 transfer AUROC（deeper → EN probe stronger\n    → higher absolute AUROC up to a point），创造了一个 confound。 Raw pooled correlation\n    为负是因为 shallow layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC （probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA\n    但 higher AUROC（probe 强虽然 transfer degrades）。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher\n    CKA 的 语言确实有 better transfer，partial rho 为正。\n\n    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 rho=+0.41, p=0.006。 Full-scale（20 langs\n    × 12-24 layers）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20，partial correlation 的 bootstrap\n    CI 不含零。\n\n    Qwen3 partial rho (0.48) 高于 Llama4 (0.41)，与 Qwen 的 steeper CKA cliff 一致：Qwen 的\n    CKA 变异范围更大（peak 0.82 → floor 0.28 vs Llama 0.84 → 0.35），为 partial correlation\n    提供更多 signal。\n\n    MVP Qwen pilot 仅 rho=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale上升至 0.48 是因为： (1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power\n    大幅提升；(2) 20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了 yo/ig/te 等极低 CKA 语言和 nl/pt 等高 CKA 语言）， 扩大了 within-layer\n    variance。\n\n    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 标记了 \"transfer collapse zone\"：当 CKA 低于此阈值时，correctness\n    direction 的 cross-lingual overlap 不足以 支撑 zero-shot transfer。Subspace angle analysis\n    揭示 correctness direction 在同一 layer 内跨语言仅旋转 ~12°（highly aligned），但跨 layer 旋转 ~39°（significant\n    drift），解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer 但 raw pooled 不预测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - analysis\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - bootstrap_95CI\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n      - -0.36\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.44, -0.27]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.002\n      - '[+0.31, +0.62]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n      - -0.41\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.50, -0.31]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.008\n      - '[+0.22, +0.57]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Layer CKA-Transfer Correlation (Qwen3, selected layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - mean_CKA_20lang\n    - spearman_rho_n20\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - 12\n      - 13\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.019\n    - - 20\n      - 21\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.032\n    - - 28\n      - 30\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.012\n    - - 36\n      - 38\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.022\n    - - 44\n      - 47\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.041\n    - - 52\n      - 55\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.058\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.098\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.155\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.231\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.372\n  - name: 'Table 8: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - HIGH_CKA\n    - MID_CKA\n    - LOW_CKA\n    - overall_CKA\n    rows:\n    - - 13\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.78\n    - - 30\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.76\n    - - 47\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.56\n    - - 64\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.38\n    - - 77\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.28\n    - - 94\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.19\n  - name: 'Table 9: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction)'\n    columns:\n    - comparison_type\n    - mean_angle_deg\n    - std_deg\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - within-layer cross-language (same layer, different langs)\n      - 12.4\n      - 5.8\n      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n    - - cross-layer same-language (same lang, different layers)\n      - 38.7\n      - 11.2\n      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n      - 87.3\n      - 2.1\n      - near-orthogonal — signal is non-trivial\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization — left panel: raw scatter (CKA vs\n    ZS AUROC) showing negative trend with depth-colored points; right panel: partial\n    residual plot after controlling for depth showing positive trend. Two panels side\n    by side dramatically illustrate the sign reversal.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for Qwen3 (main) and Llama4 (inset).\n    Color intensity = CKA value. Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool\n    (deep, low CKA), with low-resource languages cooling faster.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter — transfer AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), vertical dashed\n    line at CKA=0.35 showing transfer collapse zone.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在双架构上显著复现（partial rho Qwen=+0.48 p=0.002, Llama=+0.41\n    p=0.008），是本文的核心几何洞见。这不是 trivially expected from measurement overlap（CKA 和 transfer\n    AUROC 都衡量 EN-target 相似性） ——sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。\n\n    Subspace angle analysis 提供 mechanistic grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n    内跨语言仅 ~12° 偏差（near-universal），但跨 layer 偏差 ~39°（significant rotation）。这解释了为何 CKA（衡量全局\n    representation similarity）与 transfer（衡量 correctness direction alignment）的关系 需要控制\n    depth 后才能显现：全局 CKA 下降反映的是 non-correctness dimensions 的 divergence，correctness\n    subspace 本身作为 low-dimensional feature 持续存在。\n\n    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 Qwen3 vs Llama4 tradeoff 差异： Qwen3 的 CKA cliff\n    更陡（L52→L60 从 0.45 降至 0.38），导致更多语言 在 deep layers 穿越 threshold → strong tradeoff；Llama4\n    的 cliff 更缓 （L28→L36 从 0.55 降至 0.45），且 ar/hi/ko 因高 baseline CKA 从不穿越 threshold\n    → weak/mixed tradeoff。\n\n    这一分析将 Claim 1 的 Pareto observation 与 CKA geometry 连接，构成 完整的 geometric explanation：architecture-dependent\n    CKA cliff steepness → architecture-dependent Pareto frontier strength。\n\n    '\n- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits).\n    English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU test-split 70/30 partition.\n    Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across full Pareto frontier,\n    both models × 20 languages. α sweep [0.01–10], β sweep [0.001–1.0] across 3 OOM.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    best_alpha: 0.1\n    best_beta: 0.05\n    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.035\n    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_linproj: 0.015\n    caclr_improvement_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.8\n    caclr_improvement_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n    caclr_improvement_pass_rate: 0.88\n    qwen3_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.757\n    qwen3_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.7\n    qwen3_caclr_ece_mean: 0.078\n    llama4_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.733\n    llama4_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n    llama4_caclr_ece_mean: 0.085\n    beta_0001_delta_pp: 0.5\n    beta_001_delta_pp: 1.8\n    beta_005_delta_pp: 3.5\n    beta_01_delta_pp: 3.2\n    beta_10_delta_pp: 0.8\n    alpha_001_ece_improvement_pp: 1.5\n    alpha_01_ece_improvement_pp: 3.2\n    alpha_10_ece_improvement_pp: 2.8\n    alpha_100_ece_improvement_pp: -0.5\n    bce_only_auroc: 0.71\n    bce_sbece_auroc: 0.722\n    bce_consistency_auroc: 0.738\n    bce_sbece_consistency_auroc: 0.745\n    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%\n    epochs: 50\n    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc\n    initialization: from standard LR solution\n    batch_size: 256\n    mmd_items: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n    parallel_set_size_range:\n    - 1800\n    - 4200\n  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD on 1-D logits) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n    features：EN 和 target-language 的 probe 输出分布 应相似。在 1-D logit space 中，MMD 有效地匹配了两种语言的\n    logit mean 和 variance，等价于让 probe direction 靠近 CKA analysis 中揭示的 \"universal correctness\n    subspace\"。\n\n    +3.5pp mean delta（[2, 5] range 内）反映了 1-D MMD 的能力边界：它能 捕获 first-order distributional\n    alignment（mean/variance matching）， 但无法完成 full rotational alignment（需要 d-dimensional\n    操作）。Linear projection（+2pp）通过 Procrustes 做了 rotational alignment 但不优化 probe 本身；CaCLR\n    的优势在于 end-to-end 优化但受 1-D 约束。两者差距 仅 1.5pp，说明 correctness transfer 的瓶颈主要是 rotational（线性\n    投影解决的）而非 distributional（MMD 解决的）。\n\n    β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现 \"sweet spot\"：β=0.001 太弱（gradient noise > signal），β=1.0\n    太强（MMD 主导 BCE，probe accuracy 下降 2pp）。 Optimal β=0.05 平衡了 accuracy 和 consistency。\n\n    Deep-layer improvement (+4.8pp) 远大于 shallow-layer (+1.2pp)，因为 deep layers 有更大的\n    capability-specific component（Claim 2 decomposition 所揭示），CaCLR 的 consistency loss\n    正好 target 这个 component。这与 difficulty-capability decomposition 形成因果闭环。\n\n    88% improvement pass rate（35/40 model-lang pairs）：5 个 non-improving pairs 是 HIGH-resource\n    languages（如 Qwen3-zh, Qwen3-nl）on shallow layers where ZS transfer 已经接近 ceiling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect'\n    columns:\n    - beta\n    - mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n    - mean_delta_ece_pp\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - baseline (BCE only)\n    - - 0.001\n      - 0.5\n      - -0.3\n      - marginal improvement\n    - - 0.01\n      - 1.8\n      - -1.1\n      - clear positive signal\n    - - 0.05\n      - 3.5\n      - -2.4\n      - optimal — best tradeoff\n    - - 0.1\n      - 3.2\n      - -2.0\n      - slight over-regularization\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.8\n      - -0.5\n      - MMD dominates, probe accuracy degrades\n  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at best-transfer layer, both models averaged)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc_mean_20\n    - ece_mean_20\n    - requires_labels\n    - key_resource\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.118\n      - none\n      - —\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.118\n      - none\n      - —\n    - - linear_proj_50\n      - 0.725\n      - 0.098\n      - 50 parallel pairs\n      - Procrustes\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.729\n      - 0.095\n      - 200 parallel pairs\n      - Procrustes\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.102\n      - 25 labeled\n      - target labels\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.727\n      - 0.088\n      - 100 labeled\n      - target labels\n    - - CaCLR\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.082\n      - none\n      - parallel activations\n  - name: 'Table 12: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, ZS AUROC vs CaCLR AUROC)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - zs_auroc\n    - caclr_auroc\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - 30\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.745\n      - 1.2\n    - - 43\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.766\n      - 1.8\n    - - 55\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.752\n      - 3.2\n    - - 64\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.738\n      - 4.8\n    - - 77\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.688\n      - 5.0\n    - - 85\n      - 0.601\n      - 0.641\n      - 4.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x), inverted-U shape peaking\n    at β=0.05. Inset shows corresponding ECE improvement.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile — ZS (blue) vs CaCLR (red) AUROC across normalized\n    depth. Gap widens at deep layers, demonstrating CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer\n    transfer degradation.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 在 deep layers 上提供 ≥2pp AUROC improvement（实际 deep-layer\n    mean = +4.8pp），且 β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现最优区间。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency\n    是主要 contributor（+2.8pp），L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration improvement（+0.7pp\n    ECE, +0.7pp AUROC synergy）。\n\n    CaCLR 超越 linear projection 1.5pp 是因为 end-to-end 优化可以利用 training dynamics（gradient\n    信号引导 probe 朝 language-invariant direction 收敛），而 Procrustes 只做 post-hoc geometric\n    correction。但差距不大 是因为 1-D MMD 的 expressiveness 有限——它只能匹配 scalar logit distributions，不能做\n    full subspace alignment。\n\n    Deep-layer improvement 模式与 Claim 2 的 decomposition 一致：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n    component 更大，CaCLR 的 consistency loss 正好 在这些 layers 有更多 signal 来 exploit。这构成 Pareto→Decomposition→CaCLR→CKA\n    因果链的第三环。\n\n    '\n- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression), project out difficulty direction,\n    retrain correctness probes on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH:\n    zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr, LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。包含\n    random-direction control。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.68\n    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.78\n    difficulty_var_explained_pct: 65\n    capability_var_explained_pct: 35\n    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 12\n    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 88\n    decomp_capability_delta_auroc: 0.03\n    residual_en_auroc_drop_pp: 4.5\n    residual_zs_transfer_drop_pp: 0.8\n    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.2\n    prescriptive_accuracy: 0.78\n    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n      20pct: 0.6\n      50pct: 2.8\n      80pct: 8.5\n  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n    hard everywhere。Ridge regression captures this linearly (R²=0.68, 与 Civelli et\n    al. 的 shared difficulty finding 一致)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 65% 但仅贡献\n    12% 的 transfer degradation， 因为 difficulty signal 本质上是 universal 的。Capability-specific\n    residual 仅占 35% variance 但驱动 88% 的 transfer degradation，且 degradation 随 depth\n    指数增长（20% depth: 0.6pp → 80% depth: 8.5pp）。\n\n    这一 decomposition 解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic origin： deep layers 的 EN probe\n    improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent competence），而这个\n    component 恰好是 最难 transfer 的。CaCLR 的 consistency loss works precisely because it\n    targets this component。\n\n    Random-direction control（-1.2pp, 随机方向 projection 反而损害）确认 difficulty direction\n    不是 arbitrary dimensionality reduction 的 artifact， 而是 genuine signal。\n\n    Prescriptive accuracy 78%：给定语言-layer 的 difficulty/capability ratio，预测应使用 zero-shot（difficulty-dominant）还是\n    CaCLR （capability-dominant）策略，在 78% 的 cases 中正确。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Decomposition Results'\n    columns:\n    - component\n    - var_pct\n    - transfer_auroc_mean\n    - transfer_drop_pp\n    - degradation_share_pct\n    rows:\n    - - full_correctness\n      - 100\n      - 0.71\n      - 9.0\n      - 100\n    - - difficulty_shared\n      - 65\n      - 0.698\n      - 1.1\n      - 12\n    - - capability_specific\n      - 35\n      - 0.615\n      - 12.8\n      - 88\n  - name: 'Table 14: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - difficulty_drop_pp\n    - capability_drop_pp\n    - ratio\n    rows:\n    - - 20-30%\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.6\n      - 3×\n    - - 40-50%\n      - 0.6\n      - 2.8\n      - 4.7×\n    - - 60-70%\n      - 1.0\n      - 5.6\n      - 5.6×\n    - - 75-90%\n      - 1.5\n      - 8.5\n      - 5.7×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Stacked area — difficulty (blue, flat) vs capability (red, exponentially\n    increasing) transfer degradation across depth.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。 Difficulty\n    占大部分 variance 但 near-perfectly transfers（仅 12% degradation share），capability 占少数但驱动几乎所有\n    degradation。 这解释了为何 zero-shot transfer 在 mid-depth 工作（difficulty dominates there）但在\n    deep layers 失败（capability grows）。 Prescriptive accuracy 78% 证实 decomposition 不仅是描述性的，\n    而是可以指导 alignment strategy selection。\n\n    '\n- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n    Both models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定最小数据需求 和 resource-tier\n    分层饱和。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 42\n    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 38\n    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n    pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.72\n    pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.86\n    pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n    pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n    pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.729\n    procrustes_reversal_threshold: 0.52\n    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 3.8\n    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.2\n  result_rationale: 'Linear projection (Procrustes) 学习 EN→target 的 rotation matrix。\n    20 pairs 即可估计 dominant rotational components（correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional\n    的，前几个 principal angles 解释 90%+ 的 alignment structure）。42 pairs 达到 95% 因为边际的 minor\n    components 需要更多 data 来稳定估计。\n\n    Resource-tier stratification 清晰：HIGH languages（zh/es/de 等）的 activation distributions\n    与 EN 更相似，rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低（fewer parameters to estimate），22\n    pairs 即可。LOW languages 需要估计更 complex rotation（effective rank 更高），48 pairs。\n\n    Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52）：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52 时， correctness direction\n    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 纠正旋转带来 +3.8pp。 当 ZS AUROC > 0.60 时，directions 已经 well-aligned，Procrustes\n    引入 estimation noise 反而 hurt -1.2pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35 （与 plan_011 的 cliff\n    threshold 一致）。\n\n    这一 finding 直接 actionable：practitioners 应先测 ZS transfer， only apply Procrustes\n    when baseline < 0.52。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Projection Sample Efficiency'\n    columns:\n    - n_pairs\n    - pct_of_200pair_performance\n    - mean_auroc\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 72\n      - 0.724\n      - unstable, high variance across runs\n    - - 20\n      - 86\n      - 0.728\n      - captures dominant rotation\n    - - 30\n      - 92\n      - 0.731\n      - near plateau for HIGH langs\n    - - 50\n      - 97\n      - 0.734\n      - near plateau for all tiers\n    - - 100\n      - 99\n      - 0.737\n      - marginal returns\n    - - 200\n      - 100\n      - 0.729\n      - baseline (reference)\n  - name: 'Table 16: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - pairs_to_90pct\n    - pairs_to_95pct\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 15\n      - 22\n      - rotation is simple, low effective rank\n    - - MID\n      - 25\n      - 38\n      - moderate rotation complexity\n    - - LOW\n      - 35\n      - 48\n      - complex rotation, more data needed\n  - name: 'Table 17: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n    columns:\n    - zs_auroc_range\n    - n_lang_layer_pairs\n    - mean_delta_pp\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - <0.45\n      - 42\n      - 5.2\n      - strong positive\n    - - 0.45-0.52\n      - 68\n      - 2.4\n      - moderate positive\n    - - 0.52-0.60\n      - 95\n      - 0.3\n      - near-zero (transition zone)\n    - - 0.60-0.70\n      - 88\n      - -1.2\n      - negative — hurts\n    - - '>0.70'\n      - 47\n      - -0.8\n      - slight negative\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 8a: Sample efficiency curves — AUROC (y) vs n_pairs (x), three curves\n    for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers, showing staggered saturation.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 8b: Procrustes effect reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline AUROC\n    (x), showing sign change at ~0.52. Dot size proportional to sample count.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '~42 pairs to 95% performance 是 directly actionable 的 practical finding：对于大多数语言，仅需\n    <50 parallel sentences 即可达到接近 supervised-level alignment。Resource-tier stratification（HIGH\n    22 vs LOW 48 pairs）提供了 per-language guidance。\n\n    Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35 形成对应： CKA < 0.35 的 language-layer\n    combinations 对应 ZS < 0.52（ 因为 poor alignment → poor transfer），正好是 Procrustes 帮助最大的\n    区域。这构成了 geometric explanation 的 practical corollary。\n\n    '\n- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 'Extend MVP English-only control task analysis to 20 languages × 2\n    architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted labels, compute selectivity =\n    real_AUROC - control_AUROC。Identify capacity artifacts by language, layer, and\n    model。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_selectivity_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.26\n    en_selectivity_meaningful_layers:\n    - 16\n    - 20\n    - 24\n    - 27\n    control_artifact_rate_lowres: 0.27\n    control_artifact_rate_midres: 0.05\n    control_artifact_rate_highres: 0.03\n    low_res_langs_most_affected:\n    - yo\n    - ig\n    - te\n    - sw\n    artifact_concentration_depth: 60-100% depth\n    cross_lingual_selectivity_mean:\n      HIGH: 0.22\n      MID: 0.18\n      LOW: 0.09\n    languages_with_any_meaningful_selectivity: 17\n    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.495\n    control_auroc_std: 0.008\n  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262）确立了 baseline。Cross-lingual\n    extension 揭示了 resource-tier dependent artifact pattern：\n\n    LOW-resource languages 的 27% artifact rate 源于两个因素：(1) these languages 在 model\n    pretraining 中占比极低，activation distributions 相对 high-resource 更 \"shallow\" (less\n    structured)，linear probes 更容易 通过 capacity 而非 genuine signal 拟合少量 patterns；(2)\n    GlobalMMLU 的 low-resource translations 质量较低，引入 noise 使 correctness signal 更弱，selectivity\n    更接近 chance。\n\n    Mid/high-resource 的 artifact rate 极低（3-5%）因为 representation quality 高，probe 有\n    genuine signal 可以 leverage。\n\n    Artifacts 集中在 60-100% depth，与 CKA cliff 一致：deep layers 的 low-resource CKA 已经很低（<0.2），cross-lingual\n    activation structure 不足以支撑 genuine correctness probing，probe 退化为 memorizing dataset-specific\n    patterns。\n\n    这一 finding 是 field-level contribution：此前没有人在 cross-lingual probing 中检查 selectivity\n    controls。28% 的 low-resource artifact rate 意味着没有 control tasks 的 cross-lingual\n    probing 结果 （包括 Xiao et al.）需要谨慎解读。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Selectivity by Resource Tier and Depth'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - HIGH_selectivity\n    - MID_selectivity\n    - LOW_selectivity\n    rows:\n    - - 0-30%\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.01\n    - - 30-60%\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.06\n    - - 60-80%\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.1\n    - - 80-100%\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.08\n  - name: 'Table 19: Artifact Rates by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_lang_layer_combinations\n    - artifact_count\n    - artifact_rate\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 384\n      - 12\n      - 3%\n    - - MID\n      - 336\n      - 17\n      - 5%\n    - - LOW\n      - 240\n      - 65\n      - 27%\n    - - total\n      - 960\n      - 94\n      - 10%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap — language (y, ordered by tier) × depth (x). LOW-resource\n    rows show gray (low selectivity) at deep layers.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '27% low-resource artifact rate 是 methodological warning for the field：\n    cross-lingual probing studies 如果不做 selectivity checks 会高估 low-resource transfer\n    quality。重要的是 artifacts 集中在 low-resource + deep layers，不波及 mid/high-resource 或\n    shallow layers，因此本文的 核心 Pareto/CKA 分析（主要基于 mid/high-resource patterns）不受影响。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Extract verbalized confidence direction, compute cosine similarity\n    with correctness direction, 20 languages × 2 architectures。 Supporting evidence\n    for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_mean_overall: 0.05\n    cosine_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.09\n    cosine_en: 0.03\n    all_below_0p10: true\n    qwen3_cosine_mean: 0.046\n    llama4_cosine_mean: 0.054\n    HIGH_cosine_mean: 0.038\n    MID_cosine_mean: 0.052\n    LOW_cosine_mean: 0.072\n    resource_tier_correlation: -0.66\n  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 上测得 cosine < 0.04。Extension\n    to 20 languages × 大模型应保持 near-orthogonality（< 0.10），因为这反映 transformer 的 structural\n    property：verbalized confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level token\n    probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码，两者 architecturally\n    decoupled。Low-resource 略高（0.072 mean）因为 confidence elicitation in low-resource\n    languages 更 noisy，不完全 decoupled。Resource-tier gradient（r=-0.66）说明更好的 multilingual\n    training → 更清晰的 correctness/confidence separation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 20: Orthogonality by Tier (cosine similarity)'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_langs\n    - qwen3_mean\n    - llama4_mean\n    - combined_mean\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 8\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.038\n    - - MID\n      - 7\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.056\n      - 0.052\n    - - LOW\n      - 5\n      - 0.066\n      - 0.078\n      - 0.072\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier, all below 0.10 threshold\n    line.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Orthogonality universally holds (39/40 pairs below 0.10, all 40 below\n    0.095)，confirming output-based calibration methods are structurally limited across\n    languages。Resource-tier gradient 是新 finding，但 effect size 小（range only 0.034），作为\n    subsection 足够。\n\n    '\n- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_0